					<div id="contentSub"><div id="mw-content-subtitle"></div></div>
					
					
					<div id="mw-content-text" class="mw-body-content"><div class="mw-subjectpageheader">
</div><div class="mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output" lang="en" dir="ltr" data-mw-parsoid-version="0.24.0.0-alpha17" data-mw-html-version="2.8.0"><section data-mw-section-id="0" id="mwAQ"><div class="shortdescription nomobile noexcerpt noprint searchaux" style="display:none" about="#mwt1" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAg" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Short description&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Short_description&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Decade of the Gregorian calendar (2020–2029)&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}">Decade of the Gregorian calendar (2020–2029)</div><span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt1"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_with_short_description"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Short_description_is_different_from_Wikidata"></span>
<span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt2" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAw" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Accessibility dispute&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Accessibility_dispute&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;date&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;July 2024&quot;},&quot;reason&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Article has too many files that may time out on mobile versions of Wikipedia. Ideally, a page should have no more than 100 images (regardless of how small they are). See [[mediawikiwiki:Recommendations for mobile friendly articles on Wikimedia wikis#Limit number of images in a page|MediaWiki:Limit number of images in a page]]&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"></span><table class="box-Accessibility_dispute plainlinks metadata ambox ambox-content" role="presentation" about="#mwt2"><tbody><tr><td class="mbox-image"><div class="mbox-image-div"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img alt="" resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Preferences-desktop-accessibility-alert.svg" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/57/Preferences-desktop-accessibility-alert.svg/60px-Preferences-desktop-accessibility-alert.svg.png" decoding="async" data-file-width="48" data-file-height="48" data-file-type="drawing" height="45" width="45" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/57/Preferences-desktop-accessibility-alert.svg/120px-Preferences-desktop-accessibility-alert.svg.png 2x" class="mw-file-element"></span></span></div></td><td class="mbox-text"><div class="mbox-text-span"><b>The <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Manual_of_Style/Accessibility" title="Wikipedia:Manual of Style/Accessibility">accessibility</a> of this article is in question</b>. The specific issue is: <b>Article has too many files that may time out on mobile versions of Wikipedia. Ideally, a page should have no more than 100 images (regardless of how small they are). See <a rel="mw:WikiLink/Interwiki" href="https://www.mediawiki.org/wiki/Recommendations%20for%20mobile%20friendly%20articles%20on%20Wikimedia%20wikis#Limit_number_of_images_in_a_page" title="mediawikiwiki:Recommendations for mobile friendly articles on Wikimedia wikis" class="extiw">MediaWiki:Limit number of images in a page</a></b>. Relevant discussion may be found on the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:2020s#" title="Talk:2020s">talk page</a>.  <span class="date-container"><i>(<span class="date">July 2024</span>)</i></span></div></td></tr></tbody></table><span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt2"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_with_accessibility_problems"></span>
<p class="mw-empty-elt" id="mwBA"><span typeof="mw:Nowiki mw:Transclusion" about="#mwt4" id="mwBQ" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Use British English&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Use_British_English&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;date&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;March 2026&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Use_British_English_from_March_2026" about="#mwt4"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:All_Wikipedia_articles_written_in_British_English" about="#mwt4" id="mwBg">
<span typeof="mw:Nowiki mw:Transclusion" about="#mwt5" id="mwBw" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Use dmy dates&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Use_dmy_dates&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;date&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;September 2025&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Use_dmy_dates_from_September_2025" about="#mwt5" id="mwCA"></p>
<span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt6" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwCQ" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:multiple image&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;\n&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; image_style       = border:none;\n&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; perrow            = 2/2\n&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; image1            = Novel Coronavirus SARS-CoV-2 (cropped).jpg\n&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; image2            = 2021 storming of the United States Capitol DSC09254-2 (50820534063) (retouched).jpg\n&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; image3            = People cheering in front of the Prime Minister's Office after Sheikh Hasina's resignation.jpg\n&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; image4            = Artemis II Launch (SLS MAF 20260401 ArtemisII-Launch-epb 003).jpg\n&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; image5            = Mobile phone with ChatGPT on keyboard (52916924616).jpg\n&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; image6            = Syrians celebrate the fall of Assad at the Umayyad mosque, 14 December 2024.jpg\n&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; image7            = Russian bombardment of telecommunications antennas in Kiev (3to4).jpg\n&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; image8            = Images of war 23-25 from Gaza, by Jaber Badwen, IMG 6185.jpg\n&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; total_width       = 350\n&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; footer            = '''Clockwise from top-left:'''\n* An image of [[SARS-CoV-2]], a virus that caused the '''[[COVID-19 pandemic]]'''; [[COVID-19]] became a global pandemic in 2020 and was deemed an international public health emergency until 2023.\n* The '''[[January 6 United States Capitol attack]]''' over [[Attempts to overturn the 2020 United States presidential election|claims of electoral fraud]] during the [[2020 United States presidential election|2020 presidential election]]; the decade witnessed widespread [[democratic backsliding]] as many countries shifted from [[liberal democracy]] to [[authoritarianism]].\n* The '''[[Artemis II]]''' flyby of the Moon, the first crewed flight beyond [[low Earth orbit]] since 1972, was launched in 2026, with the crew breaking the record for the furthest humans have been from Earth.\n* In December 2024, Syrian rebels celebrate the '''[[fall of the Assad regime]]''', ending 62 years of [[Ba'athist Syria|Ba'athist rule]].\n* Israel '''[[Gaza war|invades]]''' the [[Gaza Strip]], in response to the [[October 7 attacks]] in 2023. Throughout the decade, the war spilled over into major parts of the [[Middle Eastern crisis (2023–present)|Middle East]].\n* Russia launches a '''[[Russo-Ukrainian war (2022–present)|full scale invasion]]''' of Ukraine in 2022, starting a new phase of the [[Russo-Ukrainian war]], which has been ongoing since 2014.\n* [[ChatGPT]], the commercial engine of domestic AI usage as a symbol of the '''[[AI boom]]''' during the decade.\n* The [[July Revolution (Bangladesh)|July Revolution]] in [[Bangladesh]], described as the world's first '''[[Gen Z protests|Gen Z revolution]]''', spread around the world against [[democratic backsliding]], [[political corruption]], and [[authoritarianism]], where young protesters overthrow their governments.\n&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"></span><div class="thumb tmulti floatright" about="#mwt6"><div class="thumbinner multiimageinner" style="width:342px;max-width:342px"><div class="trow"><div class="tsingle" style="width:142px;max-width:142px"><div class="thumbimage" style="border:none;;height:119px;overflow:hidden"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Novel_Coronavirus_SARS-CoV-2_(cropped).jpg" class="mw-file-description"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Novel_Coronavirus_SARS-CoV-2_(cropped).jpg" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/Novel_Coronavirus_SARS-CoV-2_%28cropped%29.jpg/250px-Novel_Coronavirus_SARS-CoV-2_%28cropped%29.jpg" decoding="async" data-file-width="2807" data-file-height="2390" data-file-type="bitmap" height="119" width="140" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/Novel_Coronavirus_SARS-CoV-2_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Novel_Coronavirus_SARS-CoV-2_%28cropped%29.jpg 2x" class="mw-file-element"></a></span></div></div><div class="tsingle" style="width:196px;max-width:196px"><div class="thumbimage" style="border:none;;height:119px;overflow:hidden"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:2021_storming_of_the_United_States_Capitol_DSC09254-2_(50820534063)_(retouched).jpg" class="mw-file-description"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:2021_storming_of_the_United_States_Capitol_DSC09254-2_(50820534063)_(retouched).jpg" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4f/2021_storming_of_the_United_States_Capitol_DSC09254-2_%2850820534063%29_%28retouched%29.jpg/250px-2021_storming_of_the_United_States_Capitol_DSC09254-2_%2850820534063%29_%28retouched%29.jpg" decoding="async" data-file-width="4887" data-file-height="2998" data-file-type="bitmap" height="119" width="194" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4f/2021_storming_of_the_United_States_Capitol_DSC09254-2_%2850820534063%29_%28retouched%29.jpg/500px-2021_storming_of_the_United_States_Capitol_DSC09254-2_%2850820534063%29_%28retouched%29.jpg 2x" class="mw-file-element"></a></span></div></div></div><div class="trow"><div class="tsingle" style="width:154px;max-width:154px"><div class="thumbimage" style="border:none;;height:113px;overflow:hidden"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:People_cheering_in_front_of_the_Prime_Minister's_Office_after_Sheikh_Hasina's_resignation.jpg" class="mw-file-description"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:People_cheering_in_front_of_the_Prime_Minister's_Office_after_Sheikh_Hasina's_resignation.jpg" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8a/People_cheering_in_front_of_the_Prime_Minister%27s_Office_after_Sheikh_Hasina%27s_resignation.jpg/250px-People_cheering_in_front_of_the_Prime_Minister%27s_Office_after_Sheikh_Hasina%27s_resignation.jpg" decoding="async" data-file-width="4000" data-file-height="3000" data-file-type="bitmap" height="114" width="152" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8a/People_cheering_in_front_of_the_Prime_Minister%27s_Office_after_Sheikh_Hasina%27s_resignation.jpg/330px-People_cheering_in_front_of_the_Prime_Minister%27s_Office_after_Sheikh_Hasina%27s_resignation.jpg 2x" class="mw-file-element"></a></span></div></div><div class="tsingle" style="width:184px;max-width:184px"><div class="thumbimage" style="border:none;;height:113px;overflow:hidden"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Artemis_II_Launch_(SLS_MAF_20260401_ArtemisII-Launch-epb_003).jpg" class="mw-file-description"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Artemis_II_Launch_(SLS_MAF_20260401_ArtemisII-Launch-epb_003).jpg" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a3/Artemis_II_Launch_%28SLS_MAF_20260401_ArtemisII-Launch-epb_003%29.jpg/250px-Artemis_II_Launch_%28SLS_MAF_20260401_ArtemisII-Launch-epb_003%29.jpg" decoding="async" data-file-width="7889" data-file-height="4914" data-file-type="bitmap" height="113" width="182" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a3/Artemis_II_Launch_%28SLS_MAF_20260401_ArtemisII-Launch-epb_003%29.jpg/500px-Artemis_II_Launch_%28SLS_MAF_20260401_ArtemisII-Launch-epb_003%29.jpg 2x" class="mw-file-element"></a></span></div></div></div><div class="trow"><div class="tsingle" style="width:168px;max-width:168px"><div class="thumbimage" style="border:none;;height:93px;overflow:hidden"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Mobile_phone_with_ChatGPT_on_keyboard_(52916924616).jpg" class="mw-file-description"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Mobile_phone_with_ChatGPT_on_keyboard_(52916924616).jpg" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d0/Mobile_phone_with_ChatGPT_on_keyboard_%2852916924616%29.jpg/250px-Mobile_phone_with_ChatGPT_on_keyboard_%2852916924616%29.jpg" decoding="async" data-file-width="6629" data-file-height="3750" data-file-type="bitmap" height="94" width="166" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d0/Mobile_phone_with_ChatGPT_on_keyboard_%2852916924616%29.jpg/500px-Mobile_phone_with_ChatGPT_on_keyboard_%2852916924616%29.jpg 2x" class="mw-file-element"></a></span></div></div><div class="tsingle" style="width:170px;max-width:170px"><div class="thumbimage" style="border:none;;height:93px;overflow:hidden"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Syrians_celebrate_the_fall_of_Assad_at_the_Umayyad_mosque,_14_December_2024.jpg" class="mw-file-description"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Syrians_celebrate_the_fall_of_Assad_at_the_Umayyad_mosque,_14_December_2024.jpg" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cd/Syrians_celebrate_the_fall_of_Assad_at_the_Umayyad_mosque%2C_14_December_2024.jpg/250px-Syrians_celebrate_the_fall_of_Assad_at_the_Umayyad_mosque%2C_14_December_2024.jpg" decoding="async" data-file-width="1005" data-file-height="559" data-file-type="bitmap" height="93" width="168" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cd/Syrians_celebrate_the_fall_of_Assad_at_the_Umayyad_mosque%2C_14_December_2024.jpg/500px-Syrians_celebrate_the_fall_of_Assad_at_the_Umayyad_mosque%2C_14_December_2024.jpg 2x" class="mw-file-element"></a></span></div></div></div><div class="trow"><div class="tsingle" style="width:145px;max-width:145px"><div class="thumbimage" style="border:none;;height:107px;overflow:hidden"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Russian_bombardment_of_telecommunications_antennas_in_Kiev_(3to4).jpg" class="mw-file-description"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Russian_bombardment_of_telecommunications_antennas_in_Kiev_(3to4).jpg" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e9/Russian_bombardment_of_telecommunications_antennas_in_Kiev_%283to4%29.jpg/250px-Russian_bombardment_of_telecommunications_antennas_in_Kiev_%283to4%29.jpg" decoding="async" data-file-width="1141" data-file-height="856" data-file-type="bitmap" height="107" width="143" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e9/Russian_bombardment_of_telecommunications_antennas_in_Kiev_%283to4%29.jpg/330px-Russian_bombardment_of_telecommunications_antennas_in_Kiev_%283to4%29.jpg 2x" class="mw-file-element"></a></span></div></div><div class="tsingle" style="width:193px;max-width:193px"><div class="thumbimage" style="border:none;;height:107px;overflow:hidden"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Images_of_war_23-25_from_Gaza,_by_Jaber_Badwen,_IMG_6185.jpg" class="mw-file-description"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Images_of_war_23-25_from_Gaza,_by_Jaber_Badwen,_IMG_6185.jpg" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d5/Images_of_war_23-25_from_Gaza%2C_by_Jaber_Badwen%2C_IMG_6185.jpg/250px-Images_of_war_23-25_from_Gaza%2C_by_Jaber_Badwen%2C_IMG_6185.jpg" decoding="async" data-file-width="4032" data-file-height="2268" data-file-type="bitmap" height="107" width="191" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d5/Images_of_war_23-25_from_Gaza%2C_by_Jaber_Badwen%2C_IMG_6185.jpg/500px-Images_of_war_23-25_from_Gaza%2C_by_Jaber_Badwen%2C_IMG_6185.jpg 2x" class="mw-file-element"></a></span></div></div></div><div class="trow" style="display:flex"><div class="thumbcaption"><b>Clockwise from top-left:</b>
<ul><li>An image of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SARS-CoV-2" title="SARS-CoV-2">SARS-CoV-2</a>, a virus that caused the <b><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/COVID-19_pandemic" title="COVID-19 pandemic">COVID-19 pandemic</a></b>; <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/COVID-19" title="COVID-19">COVID-19</a> became a global pandemic in 2020 and was deemed an international public health emergency until 2023.</li>
<li>The <b><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/January_6_United_States_Capitol_attack" title="January 6 United States Capitol attack">January 6 United States Capitol attack</a></b> over <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Attempts_to_overturn_the_2020_United_States_presidential_election" title="Attempts to overturn the 2020 United States presidential election">claims of electoral fraud</a> during the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2020_United_States_presidential_election" title="2020 United States presidential election">2020 presidential election</a>; the decade witnessed widespread <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Democratic_backsliding" title="Democratic backsliding">democratic backsliding</a> as many countries shifted from <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Liberal_democracy" title="Liberal democracy">liberal democracy</a> to <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Authoritarianism" title="Authoritarianism">authoritarianism</a>.</li>
<li>The <b><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Artemis_II" title="Artemis II">Artemis II</a></b> flyby of the Moon, the first crewed flight beyond <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Low_Earth_orbit" title="Low Earth orbit">low Earth orbit</a> since 1972, was launched in 2026, with the crew breaking the record for the furthest humans have been from Earth.</li>
<li>In December 2024, Syrian rebels celebrate the <b><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fall_of_the_Assad_regime" title="Fall of the Assad regime">fall of the Assad regime</a></b>, ending 62 years of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ba'athist_Syria" title="Ba'athist Syria">Ba'athist rule</a>.</li>
<li>Israel <b><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gaza_war" title="Gaza war">invades</a></b> the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gaza_Strip" title="Gaza Strip">Gaza Strip</a>, in response to the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/October_7_attacks" title="October 7 attacks">October 7 attacks</a> in 2023. Throughout the decade, the war spilled over into major parts of the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Middle_Eastern_crisis_(2023–present)" title="Middle Eastern crisis (2023–present)">Middle East</a>.</li>
<li>Russia launches a <b><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Russo-Ukrainian_war_(2022–present)" title="Russo-Ukrainian war (2022–present)">full scale invasion</a></b> of Ukraine in 2022, starting a new phase of the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Russo-Ukrainian_war" title="Russo-Ukrainian war">Russo-Ukrainian war</a>, which has been ongoing since 2014.</li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ChatGPT" title="ChatGPT">ChatGPT</a>, the commercial engine of domestic AI usage as a symbol of the <b><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/AI_boom" title="AI boom">AI boom</a></b> during the decade.</li>
<li>The <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/July_Revolution_(Bangladesh)" title="July Revolution (Bangladesh)" class="mw-redirect">July Revolution</a> in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bangladesh" title="Bangladesh">Bangladesh</a>, described as the world's first <b><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gen_Z_protests" title="Gen Z protests">Gen Z revolution</a></b>, spread around the world against <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Democratic_backsliding" title="Democratic backsliding">democratic backsliding</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Political_corruption" title="Political corruption">political corruption</a>, and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Authoritarianism" title="Authoritarianism">authoritarianism</a>, where young protesters overthrow their governments.</li></ul></div></div></div></div><span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt6"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Pages_using_multiple_image_with_auto_scaled_images"></span><span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt8" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwCg" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Decadebox&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Decadebox&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;202&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"></span><table class="sidebar nomobile nowraplinks hlist" role="navigation" about="#mwt8" id="mwCw"><tbody><tr><th class="sidebar-heading" style="padding-top: 1em;">
