<section data-mw-section-id="2" id="mwfg" aria-labelledby="Major_conflicts"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Major_conflicts">Major conflicts</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=2020s&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2" title="Edit section: Major conflicts"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt64" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwfw" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Main&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Main&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;List of wars: 2020–present&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;List of wars: 2003–2019&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1353705441" about="#mwt65" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Hatnote/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}"></span><div role="note" class="hatnote navigation-not-searchable" about="#mwt64" id="mwgA">Main articles: <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_wars:_2020–present" title="List of wars: 2020–present">List of wars: 2020–present</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_wars:_2003–2019" title="List of wars: 2003–2019">List of wars: 2003–2019</a></div>

<p id="mwgQ">The prominent wars of the decade include:</p>

