</section><section data-mw-section-id="6" id="mwCYw" aria-labelledby="Terrorist_attacks"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Terrorist_attacks">Terrorist attacks</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=2020s&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6" title="Edit section: Terrorist attacks"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt705" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwCY0" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Main&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Main&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;List of terrorist incidents#1970–present&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1353705441" about="#mwt706" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Hatnote/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}"></span><div role="note" class="hatnote navigation-not-searchable" about="#mwt705" id="mwCY4">Main article: <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_terrorist_incidents#1970–present" title="List of terrorist incidents">List of terrorist incidents §<span typeof="mw:Entity">&nbsp;</span>1970–present</a></div>

<p id="mwCY8">The most prominent <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_terrorist_incidents" title="List of terrorist incidents" id="mwCZA">terrorist attacks</a> committed against civilian populations during the decade include, but are not limited to:</p>
<table class="wikitable sortable mw-collapsible" id="mwCZE">
<tbody id="mwCZI"><tr id="mwCZM"><th id="mwCZQ">Event</th>
<th id="mwCZU">Date</th>
<th id="mwCZY">Country</th>
