<li class="gallerybox" style="width: 220px;" id="mwGBw"><div class="thumb" style="width: 215px; height: 155px;" id="mwGB0"><span typeof="mw:File" id="mwGB4"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Mark_Rutte's_visit_to_the_European_Commission_-_202410_-_P064674-270218.jpg" class="mw-file-description" title="Former Dutch Prime Minister Mark Rutte became Secretary General of NATO, he vowed to launch intelligence and military involvements focused on the Russo-Ukrainian war and the Middle Eastern crisis." id="mwGB8"><img alt="Former Dutch Prime Minister Mark Rutte became Secretary General of NATO, he vowed to launch intelligence and military involvements focused on the Russo-Ukrainian war and the Middle Eastern crisis." resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Mark_Rutte's_visit_to_the_European_Commission_-_202410_-_P064674-270218.jpg" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/59/Mark_Rutte%27s_visit_to_the_European_Commission_-_202410_-_P064674-270218.jpg/250px-Mark_Rutte%27s_visit_to_the_European_Commission_-_202410_-_P064674-270218.jpg" decoding="async" data-file-width="4000" data-file-height="2667" data-file-type="bitmap" height="123" width="185" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/59/Mark_Rutte%27s_visit_to_the_European_Commission_-_202410_-_P064674-270218.jpg/500px-Mark_Rutte%27s_visit_to_the_European_Commission_-_202410_-_P064674-270218.jpg 2x" class="mw-file-element" id="mwGCA"></a></span></div><div class="gallerytext" id="mwGCE">Former Dutch Prime Minister <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mark_Rutte" title="Mark Rutte" id="mwGCI">Mark Rutte</a> became <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Secretary_General_of_NATO" title="Secretary General of NATO" id="mwGCM">Secretary General of NATO</a>, he vowed to launch intelligence and military involvements focused on the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Russo-Ukrainian_war_(2022-present)" title="Russo-Ukrainian war (2022-present)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwGCQ">Russo-Ukrainian war</a> and the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Middle_Eastern_crisis_(2023–present)" title="Middle Eastern crisis (2023–present)" id="mwGCU">Middle Eastern crisis</a>.</div></li>
<li class="gallerybox" style="width: 220px;" id="mwGCY"><div class="thumb" style="width: 215px; height: 155px;" id="mwGCc"><span typeof="mw:File" id="mwGCg"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Securing_Our_Future_(EC_pic)_2025-03-02-15-13.jpg" class="mw-file-description" title="NATO leaders and participants at the 2025 London Summit on Ukraine." id="mwGCk"><img alt="NATO leaders and participants at the 2025 London Summit on Ukraine." resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Securing_Our_Future_(EC_pic)_2025-03-02-15-13.jpg" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2e/Securing_Our_Future_%28EC_pic%29_2025-03-02-15-13.jpg/250px-Securing_Our_Future_%28EC_pic%29_2025-03-02-15-13.jpg" decoding="async" data-file-width="5717" data-file-height="3811" data-file-type="bitmap" height="123" width="185" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2e/Securing_Our_Future_%28EC_pic%29_2025-03-02-15-13.jpg/500px-Securing_Our_Future_%28EC_pic%29_2025-03-02-15-13.jpg 2x" class="mw-file-element" id="mwGCo"></a></span></div><div class="gallerytext" id="mwGCs">NATO leaders and participants at the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2025_London_Summit_on_Ukraine" title="2025 London Summit on Ukraine" id="mwGCw">2025 London Summit on Ukraine</a>.</div></li>
<li class="gallerybox" style="width: 220px;" id="mwGC0"><div class="thumb" style="width: 215px; height: 155px;" id="mwGC4"><span typeof="mw:File" id="mwGC8"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Procesija,_pok._papa_Franjo_(5).jpg" class="mw-file-description" title="Crowds at Domus Sanctae Marthae following the death and funeral of Pope Francis after 12 years of papacy, marked the 20th anniversary of death and funeral of Pope John Paul II in 2005. Pope Leo XIV was elected as pontiff in the 2025 papal conclave two weeks later, he became the first pope to have been born in the United States as well as a dual citizenship." id="mwGDA"><img alt="Crowds at Domus Sanctae Marthae following the death and funeral of Pope Francis after 12 years of papacy, marked the 20th anniversary of death and funeral of Pope John Paul II in 2005. Pope Leo XIV was elected as pontiff in the 2025 papal conclave two weeks later, he became the first pope to have been born in the United States as well as a dual citizenship." resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Procesija,_pok._papa_Franjo_(5).jpg" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6c/Procesija%2C_pok._papa_Franjo_%285%29.jpg/250px-Procesija%2C_pok._papa_Franjo_%285%29.jpg" decoding="async" data-file-width="2769" data-file-height="1884" data-file-type="bitmap" height="125" width="184" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6c/Procesija%2C_pok._papa_Franjo_%285%29.jpg/500px-Procesija%2C_pok._papa_Franjo_%285%29.jpg 2x" class="mw-file-element" id="mwGDE"></a></span></div><div class="gallerytext" id="mwGDI">Crowds at <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Domus_Sanctae_Marthae" title="Domus Sanctae Marthae" id="mwGDM">Domus Sanctae Marthae</a> following the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Death_and_funeral_of_Pope_Francis" title="Death and funeral of Pope Francis" id="mwGDQ">death and funeral of Pope Francis</a> after 12 years of papacy, marked the 20th anniversary of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Death_and_funeral_of_Pope_John_Paul_II" title="Death and funeral of Pope John Paul II" id="mwGDU">death and funeral of Pope John Paul II</a> in 2005. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pope_Leo_XIV" title="Pope Leo XIV" id="mwGDY">Pope Leo XIV</a> was elected as pontiff in the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2025_papal_conclave" title="2025 papal conclave" class="mw-redirect" id="mwGDc">2025 papal conclave</a> two weeks later, he became the first pope to have been born in the United States as well as a dual citizenship.</div></li>
<li class="gallerybox" style="width: 220px;" id="mwGDg"><div class="thumb" style="width: 215px; height: 155px;" id="mwGDk"><span typeof="mw:File" id="mwGDo"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:2024-08-21_Event,_CDU,_Wahlkampf_mit_Friedrich_Merz_in_Erfurt_2024_STP_3111_by_Stepro.jpg" class="mw-file-description" title="The Netherlands, France, Germany, and the United Kingdom faced political crises which resulted the downfall of their cabinets due to a public discontent such as the economy, immigration, and defence since June 2024." id="mwGDs"><img alt="The Netherlands, France, Germany, and the United Kingdom faced political crises which resulted the downfall of their cabinets due to a public discontent such as the economy, immigration, and defence since June 2024." resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:2024-08-21_Event,_CDU,_Wahlkampf_mit_Friedrich_Merz_in_Erfurt_2024_STP_3111_by_Stepro.jpg" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1b/2024-08-21_Event%2C_CDU%2C_Wahlkampf_mit_Friedrich_Merz_in_Erfurt_2024_STP_3111_by_Stepro.jpg/250px-2024-08-21_Event%2C_CDU%2C_Wahlkampf_mit_Friedrich_Merz_in_Erfurt_2024_STP_3111_by_Stepro.jpg" decoding="async" data-file-width="3872" data-file-height="2581" data-file-type="bitmap" height="123" width="185" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1b/2024-08-21_Event%2C_CDU%2C_Wahlkampf_mit_Friedrich_Merz_in_Erfurt_2024_STP_3111_by_Stepro.jpg/500px-2024-08-21_Event%2C_CDU%2C_Wahlkampf_mit_Friedrich_Merz_in_Erfurt_2024_STP_3111_by_Stepro.jpg 2x" class="mw-file-element" id="mwGDw"></a></span></div><div class="gallerytext" id="mwGD0">The <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2025_Dutch_general_election" title="2025 Dutch general election" id="mwGD4">Netherlands</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2024–2025_French_political_crisis" title="2024–2025 French political crisis" id="mwGD8">France</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2024_German_government_crisis" title="2024 German government crisis" id="mwGEA">Germany</a>, and the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022_United_Kingdom_government_crisis_(disambiguation)" title="2022 United Kingdom government crisis (disambiguation)" class="mw-redirect mw-disambig" id="mwGEE">United Kingdom</a> faced political crises which resulted the downfall of their cabinets due to a public discontent such as the economy, immigration, and defence since June 2024. </div></li>
</ul>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="17" id="mwGEI" aria-labelledby="Oceania"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading4"><h4 id="Oceania">Oceania</h4><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=2020s&amp;action=edit&amp;section=17" title="Edit section: Oceania"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt1981" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwGEM" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Further&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Further&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Category:2020s in Oceania&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1353705441" about="#mwt1982" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Hatnote/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}"></span><div role="note" class="hatnote navigation-not-searchable" about="#mwt1981" id="mwGEQ">Further information: <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Category:2020s_in_Oceania" title="Category:2020s in Oceania">Category:2020s in Oceania</a></div>

