<td id="mwIBg">A 6.2 <span about="#mwt2575" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwIBk" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;M&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:M&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;W&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}">M</span><sub about="#mwt2575">w</sub><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_using_Mw_magnitude_scale" about="#mwt2575" id="mwIBo"> earthquake struck southeastern Afghanistan, killing at least 1,163 people, with 1,150 in Afghanistan and 13 in Pakistan. The earthquake was so deadly because it hit a densely populated area with buildings too weak to resist earthquakes.</td>
