</ul>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="28" id="mwIaQ" aria-labelledby="Tropical_cyclones"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading4"><h4 id="Tropical_cyclones">Tropical cyclones</h4><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=2020s&amp;action=edit&amp;section=28" title="Edit section: Tropical cyclones"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
