 2x" class="mw-file-element"></span></span><span typeof="mw:Entity">&nbsp;</span></span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/India" title="India" about="#mwt2815" id="mwI50">India</a><br id="mwI54"><span class="flagicon" about="#mwt2816" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwI58" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:flag&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;China&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><span><img alt="" resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_the_People's_Republic_of_China.svg" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fa/Flag_of_the_People%27s_Republic_of_China.svg/40px-Flag_of_the_People%27s_Republic_of_China.svg.png" decoding="async" data-file-width="900" data-file-height="600" data-file-type="drawing" height="15" width="23" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fa/Flag_of_the_People%27s_Republic_of_China.svg/60px-Flag_of_the_People%27s_Republic_of_China.svg.png 2x" class="mw-file-element"></span></span><span typeof="mw:Entity">&nbsp;</span></span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/China" title="China" about="#mwt2816" id="mwI6A">China</a></td>
<td id="mwI6E">Cyclone Mocha was a powerful and deadly <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tropical_cyclone" title="Tropical cyclone" id="mwI6I">tropical cyclone</a> that caused between 152 and 463 deaths and widespread destruction, primarily in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Myanmar" title="Myanmar" id="mwI6M">Myanmar</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bangladesh" title="Bangladesh" id="mwI6Q">Bangladesh</a>.</td>
<td id="mwI6U"></td></tr>
