g_of_Israel.svg.png 2x" class="mw-file-element"></span></span><span typeof="mw:Entity">&nbsp;</span></span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Israel" title="Israel" about="#mwt2822" id="mwI7s">Israel</a></td>
<td id="mwI7w">Storm Daniel, also known as Cyclone Daniel, was the deadliest and costliest Mediterranean tropical-like cyclone in recorded history. "Storm Daniel" resulted in thousands of Deaths, most notably in the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Libya" title="Libya" id="mwI70">Libyan</a> city of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Derna,_Libya" title="Derna, Libya" id="mwI74">Derna</a>, where torrential rains caused two dams near the city of Derna to <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Derna_dam_collapses" title="Derna dam collapses" id="mwI78">fail</a>.</td>
<td id="mwI8A"><sup about="#mwt2825" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-769" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-769&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-769" id="mwI8E"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwI8I"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwI8M">[</span>769<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwI8Q">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt2828" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-770" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-770&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-770" id="mwI8U"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwI8Y"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwI8c">[</span>770<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwI8g">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt2831" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-RWupdate7_771-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;RWupdate7&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-RWupdate7-771&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-RWupdate7-771" id="mwI8k"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwI8o"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwI8s">[</span>771<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwI8w">]</span></span></a></sup></td></tr>
<tr id="mwI80">
<td id="mwI84"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hurricane_Helene" title="Hurricane Helene" id="mwI88">Hurricane Helene</a></td>
<td id="mwI9A">24–29 September 2024</td>
<td id="mwI9E"><span class="flagicon" about="#mwt2832" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwI9I" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:flag&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Mexico&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><span><img alt="" resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Mexico.svg" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fc/Flag_of_Mexico.svg/40px-Flag_of_Mexico.svg.png" decoding="async" data-file-width="980" data-file-height="560" data-file-type="drawing" height="13" width="23" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fc/Flag_of_Mexico.svg/60px-Flag_of_Mexico.svg.png 2x" class="mw-file-element"></span></span><span typeof="mw:Entity">&nbsp;</span></span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mexico" title="Mexico" about="#mwt2832" id="mwI9M">Mexico</a><br id="mwI9Q"><span class="flagicon" about="#mwt2833" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwI9U" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:flag&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Honduras&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><span><img alt="" resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Honduras_(1949–2022,_2026–present).svg" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/79/Flag_of_Honduras_%281949%E2%80%932022%2C_2026%E2%80%93present%29.svg/40px-Flag_of_Honduras_%281949%E2%80%932022%2C_2026%E2%80%93present%29.svg.png" decoding="async" data-file-width="1200" data-file-height="600" data-file-type="drawing" height="12" width="23" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/79/Flag_of_Honduras_%281949%E2%80%932022%2C_2026%E2%80%93present%29.svg/60px-Flag_of_Honduras_%281949%E2%80%932022%2C_2026%E2%80%93present%29.svg.png 2x" class="mw-file-element"></span></span><span typeof="mw:Entity">&nbsp;</span></span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Honduras" title="Honduras" about="#mwt2833" id="mwI9Y">Honduras</a><br id="mwI9c"><span class="flagicon" about="#mwt2834" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwI9g" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:flag&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Cuba&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><span><img alt="" resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Cuba.svg" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bd/Flag_of_Cuba.svg/40px-Flag_of_Cuba.svg.png" decoding="async" data-file-width="1200" data-file-height="600" data-file-type="drawing" height="12" width="23" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bd/Flag_of_Cuba.svg/60px-Flag_of_Cuba.svg.png 2x" class="mw-file-element"></span></span><span typeof="mw:Entity">&nbsp;</span></span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cuba" title="Cuba" about="#mwt2834" id="mwI9k">Cuba</a><br id="mwI9o"><span class="flagicon" about="#mwt2835" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwI9s" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:flag&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;United States&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><span><img alt="" resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_the_United_States.svg" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/a/a4/Flag_of_the_United_States.svg/40px-Flag_of_the_United_States.svg.png" decoding="async" data-file-width="1235" data-file-height="650" data-file-type="drawing" height="12" width="23" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/a/a4/Flag_of_the_United_States.svg/60px-Flag_of_the_United_States.svg.png 2x" class="mw-file-element"></span></span><span typeof="mw:Entity">&nbsp;</span></span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States" title="United States" about="#mwt2835" id="mwI9w">United States</a></td>
<td id="mwI90">Hurricane Helene was a deadly and extremely destructive tropical cyclone which devastated parts of the southeastern United States, causing at least 252 deaths and US$78.7 billion in damage, this was the deadliest Atlantic hurricane since <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hurricane_Maria" title="Hurricane Maria" id="mwI94">Hurricane Maria</a> in 2017, and the deadliest Atlantic hurricane in the U.S. mainland since <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hurricane_Katrina" title="Hurricane Katrina" id="mwI98">Hurricane Katrina</a> in 2005.</td>
<td id="mwI-A"></td></tr>
<tr id="mwI-E">
<td id="mwI-I"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hurricane_Milton" title="Hurricane Milton" id="mwI-M">Hurricane Milton</a></td>
<td id="mwI-Q">5–12 October 2024</td>
<td id="mwI-U"><span class="flagicon" about="#mwt2836" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwI-Y" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:flag&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Mexico&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><span><img alt="" resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Mexico.svg" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fc/Flag_of_Mexico.svg/40px-Flag_of_Mexico.svg.png" decoding="async" data-file-width="980" data-file-height="560" data-file-type="drawing" height="13" width="23" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fc/Flag_of_Mexico.svg/60px-Flag_of_Mexico.svg.png 2x" class="mw-file-element"></span></span><span typeof="mw:Entity">&nbsp;</span></span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mexico" title="Mexico" about="#mwt2836" id="mwI-c">Mexico</a><br id="mwI-g"><span class="flagicon" about="#mwt2837" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwI-k" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:flag&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Cuba&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><span><img alt="" resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Cuba.svg" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bd/Flag_of_Cuba.svg/40px-Flag_of_Cuba.svg.png" decoding="async" data-file-width="1200" data-file-height="600" data-file-type="drawing" height="12" width="23" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bd/Flag_of_Cuba.svg/60px-Flag_of_Cuba.svg.png 2x" class="mw-file-element"></span></span><span typeof="mw:Entity">&nbsp;</span></span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cuba" title="Cuba" about="#mwt2837" id="mwI-o">Cuba</a><br id="mwI-s"><span class="flagicon" about="#mwt2838" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwI-w" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:flag&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;The Bahamas&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><span><img alt="" resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_the_Bahamas.svg" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/93/Flag_of_the_Bahamas.svg/40px-Flag_of_the_Bahamas.svg.png" decoding="async" data-file-width="1200" data-file-height="600" data-file-type="drawing" height="12" width="23" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/93/Flag_of_the_Bahamas.svg/60px-Flag_of_the_Bahamas.svg.png 2x" class="mw-file-element"></span></span><span typeof="mw:Entity">&nbsp;</span></span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Bahamas" title="The Bahamas" about="#mwt2838" id="mwI-0">The Bahamas</a><br id="mwI-4"><span class="flagicon" about="#mwt2839" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwI-8" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:flag&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;United States&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><span><img alt="" resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_the_United_States.svg" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/a/a4/Flag_of_the_United_States.svg/40px-Flag_of_the_United_States.svg.png" decoding="async" data-file-width="1235" data-file-height="650" data-file-type="drawing" height="12" width="23" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/a/a4/Flag_of_the_United_States.svg/60px-Flag_of_the_United_States.svg.png 2x" class="mw-file-element"></span></span><span typeof="mw:Entity">&nbsp;</span></span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States" title="United States" about="#mwt2839" id="mwI_A">United States</a></td>
<td id="mwI_E">Hurricane Milton was an extremely powerful and devastating tropical cyclone which became the most intense <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Atlantic_hurricane" title="Atlantic hurricane" id="mwI_I">Atlantic hurricane</a> ever recorded over the Gulf of Mexico, tied with <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hurricane_Rita" title="Hurricane Rita" id="mwI_M">Hurricane Rita</a> in 2005. Total damage was estimated to be US$34.3 billion.</td>
<td id="mwI_Q"></td></tr>
<tr id="mwI_U">
<td id="mwI_Y"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Typhoon_Ragasa" title="Typhoon Ragasa" id="mwI_c">Typhoon Ragasa</a></td>
<td id="mwI_g">17 September 2025</td>
<td id="mwI_k"><span class="flagicon" about="#mwt2840" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwI_o" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:flag&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Philippines&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><span><img alt="" resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_the_Philippines.svg" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/99/Flag_of_the_Philippines.svg/40px-Flag_of_the_Philippines.svg.png" decoding="async" data-file-width="1200" data-file-height="600" data-file-type="drawing" height="12" width="23" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/99/Flag_of_the_Philippines.svg/60px-Flag_of_the_Philippines.svg.png 2x" class="mw-file-element"></span></span><span typeof="mw:Entity">&nbsp;</span></span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Philippines" title="Philippines" about="#mwt2840" id="mwI_s">Philippines</a><br id="mwI_w"><span class="flagicon" about="#mwt2841" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwI_0" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:flag&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Vietnam&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><span><img alt="" resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Vietnam.svg" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/Flag_of_Vietnam.svg/40px-Flag_of_Vietnam.svg.png" decoding="async" data-file-width="900" data-file-height="600" data-file-type="drawing" height="15" width="23" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/Flag_of_Vietnam.svg/60px-Flag_of_Vietnam.svg.png 2x" class="mw-file-element"></span></span><span typeof="mw:Entity">&nbsp;</span></span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vietnam" title="Vietnam" about="#mwt2841" id="mwI_4">Vietnam</a><br id="mwI_8"><span class="flagicon" about="#mwt2842" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwJAA" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:flag&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;China&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><span><img alt="" resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_the_People's_Republic_of_China.svg" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fa/Flag_of_the_People%27s_Republic_of_China.svg/40px-Flag_of_the_People%27s_Republic_of_China.svg.png" decoding="async" data-file-width="900" data-file-height="600" data-file-type="drawing" height="15" width="23" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fa/Flag_of_the_People%27s_Republic_of_China.svg/60px-Flag_of_the_People%27s_Republic_of_China.svg.png 2x" class="mw-file-element"></span></span><span typeof="mw:Entity">&nbsp;</span></span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/China" title="China" about="#mwt2842" id="mwJAE">China</a><br id="mwJAI"><span class="flagicon" about="#mwt2843" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwJAM" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:flag&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Hong Kong&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><span><img alt="" resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Hong_Kong.svg" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5b/Flag_of_Hong_Kong.svg/40px-Flag_of_Hong_Kong.svg.png" decoding="async" data-file-width="900" data-file-height="600" data-file-type="drawing" height="15" width="23" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5b/Flag_of_Hong_Kong.svg/60px-Flag_of_Hong_Kong.svg.png 2x" class="mw-file-element"></span></span><span typeof="mw:Entity">&nbsp;</span></span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hong_Kong" title="Hong Kong" about="#mwt2843" id="mwJAQ">Hong Kong</a><br id="mwJAU"><span class="flagicon" about="#mwt2844" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwJAY" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:flag&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Taiwan&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><span><img alt="" resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_the_Republic_of_China.svg" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/72/Flag_of_the_Republic_of_China.svg/40px-Flag_of_the_Republic_of_China.svg.png" decoding="async" data-file-width="900" data-file-height="600" data-file-type="drawing" height="15" width="23" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/72/Flag_of_the_Republic_of_China.svg/60px-Flag_of_the_Republic_of_China.svg.png 2x" class="mw-file-element"></span></span><span typeof="mw:Entity">&nbsp;</span></span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taiwan" title="Taiwan" about="#mwt2844" id="mwJAc">Taiwan</a></td>
<td id="mwJAg">Typhoon Ragasa made a powerful and active <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tropical_cyclone" title="Tropical cyclone" id="mwJAk">tropical cyclone</a> that severely affected <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Extreme_points_of_the_Philippines" title="Extreme points of the Philippines" id="mwJAo">the northernmost portions</a> of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Luzon" title="Luzon" id="mwJAs">Luzon</a> in the Philippines and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hualien_County" title="Hualien County" id="mwJAw">Hualien County</a> in Taiwan, and is currently affecting <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/South_China" title="South China" id="mwJA0">South China</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hong_Kong" title="Hong Kong" id="mwJA4">Hong Kong</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Macau" title="Macau" id="mwJA8">Macau</a>. It is also, so far, the most intense tropical cyclone recorded <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tropical_cyclones_in_2025" title="Tropical cyclones in 2025" id="mwJBA">in 2025</a>.</td>
<td id="mwJBE"><sup about="#mwt2847" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-772" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-772&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-772" id="mwJBI"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwJBM"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwJBQ">[</span>772<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwJBU">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt2850" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-773" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-773&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-773" id="mwJBY"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwJBc"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwJBg">[</span>773<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwJBk">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt2853" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-774" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-774&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-774" id="mwJBo"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwJBs"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwJBw">[</span>774<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwJB0">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt2856" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-775" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-775&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-775" id="mwJB4"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwJB8"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwJCA">[</span>775<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwJCE">]</span></span></a></sup></td></tr>
