"mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tornadoes_of_2025" title="Tornadoes of 2025">2025</a>, and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tornadoes_of_2026" title="Tornadoes of 2026">2026</a></div>

