://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cameroon" title="Cameroon" about="#mwt2970" id="mwJbk">Cameroon</a><br id="mwJbo"><span class="flagicon" about="#mwt2971" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwJbs" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:flag&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Democratic Republic of Congo&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><span><img alt="" resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_the_Democratic_Republic_of_the_Congo.svg" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6f/Flag_of_the_Democratic_Republic_of_the_Congo.svg/20px-Flag_of_the_Democratic_Republic_of_the_Congo.svg.png" decoding="async" data-file-width="800" data-file-height="600" data-file-type="drawing" height="15" width="20" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6f/Flag_of_the_Democratic_Republic_of_the_Congo.svg/40px-Flag_of_the_Democratic_Republic_of_the_Congo.svg.png 2x" class="mw-file-element"></span></span><span typeof="mw:Entity">&nbsp;</span></span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Democratic_Republic_of_the_Congo" title="Democratic Republic of the Congo" about="#mwt2971" id="mwJbw">Democratic Republic of Congo</a><br id="mwJb0"><span class="flagicon" about="#mwt2972" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwJb4" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:flag&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Ethiopia&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><span><img alt="" resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Ethiopia.svg" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/71/Flag_of_Ethiopia.svg/40px-Flag_of_Ethiopia.svg.png" de