</section></section><section data-mw-section-id="59" id="mwMCE" aria-labelledby="Music"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Music">Music</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=2020s&amp;action=edit&amp;section=59" title="Edit section: Music"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt3751" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwMCI" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:multiple image&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;\n&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; align             = right\n&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; direction         = horizontal\n&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; perrow            = 2\n&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; image1            = BillieEilishO2140725-39 - 54665577407 (cropped).jpg\n&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; width1            = 135\n&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; alt1              = Billie Eilish\n&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; caption1          = \n&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; image2            = DuaLipa-byPhilipRomano.jpg\n&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; width2            = 120\n&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; alt2              = Dua Lipa\n&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; caption2          = \n&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; image3            = Olivia Rodrigo 3.jpeg\n&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; width3            = 125\n&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; alt3              = Olivia Rodrigo\n&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; caption3          = \n&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; image4            = HAIMO2210722 (31 of 51) (52233070660) (cropped).jpg\n&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; width4            = 130\n&quot;},&quot;19&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; alt4              = Taylor Swift\n&quot;},&quot;20&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; caption4          = \n&quot;},&quot;21&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; footer_align      = center\n&quot;},&quot;22&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; footer            = [[Billie Eilish]], [[Dua Lipa]], [[Olivia Rodrigo]], and [[Taylor Swift]] are the most famous successful female artists of the decade.\n&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1349637415/mw-parser-output/.tmulti" about="#mwt3752" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Multiple image/styles.css&quot;,&quot;wrapper&quot;:&quot;.tmulti&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}"></span><div class="thumb tmulti floatright" about="#mwt3751" id="mwMCM"><div class="thumbinner multiimageinner" style="width:263px;max-width:263px"><div class="trow"><div class="tsingle" style="width:137px;max-width:137px"><div class="thumbimage"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:BillieEilishO2140725-39_-_54665577407_(cropped).jpg" class="mw-file-description"><img alt="Billie Eilish" resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:BillieEilishO2140725-39_-_54665577407_(cropped).jpg" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c7/BillieEilishO2140725-39_-_54665577407_%28cropped%29.jpg/250px-BillieEilishO2140725-39_-_54665577407_%28cropped%29.jpg" decoding="async" data-file-width="779" data-file-height="1039" data-file-type="bitmap" height="180" width="135" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c7/BillieEilishO2140725-39_-_54665577407_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-BillieEilishO2140725-39_-_54665577407_%28cropped%29.jpg 2x" class="mw-file-element"></a></span></div></div><div class="tsingle" style="width:122px;max-width:122px"><div class="thumbimage"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:DuaLipa-byPhilipRomano.jpg" class="mw-file-description"><img alt="Dua Lipa" resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:DuaLipa-byPhilipRomano.jpg" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/72/DuaLipa-byPhilipRomano.jpg/120px-DuaLipa-byPhilipRomano.jpg" decoding="async" data-file-width="4024" data-file-height="6048" data-file-type="bitmap" height="180" width="120" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/72/DuaLipa-byPhilipRomano.jpg/250px-DuaLipa-byPhilipRomano.jpg 2x" class="mw-file-element"></a></span></div></div></div><div class="trow"><div class="tsingle" style="width:127px;max-width:127px"><div class="thumbimage"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Olivia_Rodrigo_3.jpeg" class="mw-file-description"><img alt="Olivia Rodrigo" resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Olivia_Rodrigo_3.jpeg" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2d/Olivia_Rodrigo_3.jpeg/250px-Olivia_Rodrigo_3.jpeg" decoding="async" data-file-width="2395" data-file-height="3340" data-file-type="bitmap" height="174" width="125" class="mw-file-element"></a></span></div></div><div class="tsingle" style="width:132px;max-width:132px"><div class="thumbimage"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:HAIMO2210722_(31_of_51)_(52233070660)_(cropped).jpg" class="mw-file-description"><img alt="Taylor Swift" resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:HAIMO2210722_(31_of_51)_(52233070660)_(cropped).jpg" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0f/HAIMO2210722_%2831_of_51%29_%2852233070660%29_%28cropped%29.jpg/250px-HAIMO2210722_%2831_of_51%29_%2852233070660%29_%28cropped%29.jpg" decoding="async" data-file-width="1098" data-file-height="1482" data-file-type="bitmap" height="175" width="130" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0f/HAIMO2210722_%2831_of_51%29_%2852233070660%29_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-HAIMO2210722_%2831_of_51%29_%2852233070660%29_%28cropped%29.jpg 2x" class="mw-file-element"></a></span></div></div></div><div class="trow" style="display:flow-root"><div class="thumbcaption" style="text-align:center"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Billie_Eilish" title="Billie Eilish">Billie Eilish</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dua_Lipa" title="Dua Lipa">Dua Lipa</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Olivia_Rodrigo" title="Olivia Rodrigo">Olivia Rodrigo</a>, and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taylor_Swift" title="Taylor Swift">Taylor Swift</a> are the most famous successful female artists of the decade.</div></div></div></div>

<!--Avoid favouritism by not mentioning specific artists; keep that to the main '2020s in music' article. Keep in mind that this subsection is merely a summary and not an advertising device or place to list your favourite groups or artists. This is mostly for long&#x2D;term, observed trends and styles.-->
<span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt3753" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwMCQ" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Main&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Main&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;2020s in music&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1353705441" about="#mwt3754" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Hatnote/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}"></span><div role="note" class="hatnote navigation-not-searchable" about="#mwt3753" id="mwMCU">Main article: <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2020s_in_music" title="2020s in music">2020s in music</a></div>

<p id="mwMCY">By 2020, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/TikTok" title="TikTok" id="mwMCc">TikTok</a>, an <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Online_video_platform" title="Online video platform" id="mwMCg">online video service</a>, had become extremely popular as a music platform on social media.<sup about="#mwt3757" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1012" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1012&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1012" id="mwMCk"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMCo"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMCs">[</span>1012<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMCw">]</span></span></a></sup> Users on streaming platforms such as <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spotify" title="Spotify" id="mwMC0">Spotify</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/YouTube_Music" title="YouTube Music" id="mwMC4">YouTube Music</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deezer" title="Deezer" id="mwMC8">Deezer</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amazon_Music" title="Amazon Music" id="mwMDA">Amazon Music</a>, and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Apple_Music" title="Apple Music" id="mwMDE">Apple Music</a> have increased due to the COVID-19 pandemic. Festivals such as <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Coachella_Valley_Music_and_Arts_Festival" title="Coachella Valley Music and Arts Festival" class="mw-redirect" id="mwMDI">Coachella</a> were cancelled because of the virus. The COVID-19 pandemic devastated the touring business.<sup about="#mwt3760" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1013" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1013&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1013" id="mwMDM"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMDQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMDU">[</span>1013<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMDY">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt3763" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1014" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1014&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1014" id="mwMDc"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMDg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMDk">[</span>1014<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMDo">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwMDs">The 2020s saw the continued impact of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Streaming_Songs" title="Streaming Songs" id="mwMDw">streaming</a> on the record industry, a trend that began in the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2010s_music" title="2010s music" class="mw-redirect" id="mwMD0">2010s</a>. Platforms like <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spotify" title="Spotify" id="mwMD4">Spotify</a> played a central role in shaping music trends, driving the success of both mainstream and emerging genres. Social media, particularly <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/TikTok" title="TikTok" id="mwMD8">TikTok</a>, further amplified music with viral trends, while popular genres like <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pop_music" title="Pop music" id="mwMEA">pop</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hip-hop" title="Hip-hop" id="mwMEE">hip-hop</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/R&amp;B" title="R&amp;B" class="mw-redirect" id="mwMEI">R&amp;B</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rock_music" title="Rock music" id="mwMEM">rock music</a> including <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pop_punk" title="Pop punk" class="mw-redirect" id="mwMEQ">pop punk</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shoegaze" title="Shoegaze" id="mwMEU">shoegaze</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Country_music" title="Country music" id="mwMEY">country</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/K-pop" title="K-pop" id="mwMEc">K-pop</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Indie_music" title="Indie music" id="mwMEg">indie music</a> dominated the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Billboard_Hot_100" title="Billboard Hot 100" id="mwMEk"><i id="mwMEo">Billboard</i> Hot 100</a> charts. At the same time, underground genres like <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hyperpop" title="Hyperpop" id="mwMEs">hyperpop</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Plugg_music" title="Plugg music" class="mw-redirect" id="mwMEw">plugg</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jersey_club" title="Jersey club" id="mwME0">jersey club</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Phonk" title="Phonk" id="mwME4">phonk</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rage_(music_genre)" title="Rage (music genre)" id="mwME8">rage</a>  thrived in niche communities.<sup about="#mwt3766" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1015" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1015&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1015" id="mwMFA"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMFE"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMFI">[</span>1015<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMFM">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt3769" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1016" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1016&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1016" id="mwMFQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMFU"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMFY">[</span>1016<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMFc">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt3772" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1017" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1017&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1017" id="mwMFg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMFk"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMFo">[</span>1017<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMFs">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt3775" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1018" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1018&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1018" id="mwMFw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMF0"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMF4">[</span>1018<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMF8">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt3778" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1019" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1019&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1019" id="mwMGA"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMGE"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMGI">[</span>1019<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMGM">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<!--NOTE:Please keep this list at or under 25 names for the time being. Only replace names as you/the wiki community sees fit, just don't add more than 25.-->
<p id="mwMGQ"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pop_music" title="Pop music" id="mwMGU">Pop</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hip-hop" title="Hip-hop" id="mwMGY">hip-hop</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rock_music" title="Rock music" id="mwMGc">rock music</a> including <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pop_punk" title="Pop punk" class="mw-redirect" id="mwMGg">pop punk</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shoegaze" title="Shoegaze" id="mwMGk">shoegaze</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eurodance" title="Eurodance" id="mwMGo">Eurodance</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Indie_music" title="Indie music" id="mwMGs">indies</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/K-pop" title="K-pop" id="mwMGw">K-pop</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Contemporary_R&amp;B" title="Contemporary R&amp;B" id="mwMG0">R&amp;B</a>,<sup about="#mwt3781" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1020" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1020&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1020" id="mwMG4"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMG8"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMHA">[</span>1020<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMHE">]</span></span></a></sup> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trance_music" title="Trance music" id="mwMHI">trance</a>, and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Synth-pop" title="Synth-pop" id="mwMHM">synth-pop</a><sup about="#mwt3784" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1021" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1021&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1021" id="mwMHQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMHU"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMHY">[</span>1021<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMHc">]</span></span></a></sup> all dominated the early part of the decade, with the most popular artists being <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ariana_Grande" title="Ariana Grande" id="mwMHg">Ariana Grande</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lizzo" title="Lizzo" id="mwMHk">Lizzo</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Drake_(musician)" title="Drake (musician)" id="mwMHo">Drake</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kendrick_Lamar" title="Kendrick Lamar" id="mwMHs">Kendrick Lamar</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nicki_Minaj" title="Nicki Minaj" id="mwMHw">Nicki Minaj</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dua_Lipa" title="Dua Lipa" id="mwMH0">Dua Lipa</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ice_Spice" title="Ice Spice" id="mwMH4">Ice Spice</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Charli_XCX" title="Charli XCX" id="mwMH8">Charli XCX</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Weeknd" title="The Weeknd" id="mwMIA">the Weeknd</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Justin_Bieber" title="Justin Bieber" id="mwMIE">Justin Bieber</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taylor_Swift" title="Taylor Swift" id="mwMII">Taylor Swift</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chappell_Roan" title="Chappell Roan" id="mwMIM">Chappell Roan</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Doja_Cat" title="Doja Cat" id="mwMIQ">Doja Cat</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Olivia_Rodrigo" title="Olivia Rodrigo" id="mwMIU">Olivia Rodrigo</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Billie_Eilish" title="Billie Eilish" id="mwMIY">Billie Eilish</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Playboi_Carti" title="Playboi Carti" id="mwMIc">Playboi Carti</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Morgan_Wallen" title="Morgan Wallen" id="mwMIg">Morgan Wallen</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beyoncé" title="Beyoncé" id="mwMIk">Beyoncé</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sabrina_Carpenter" title="Sabrina Carpenter" id="mwMIo">Sabrina Carpenter</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jelly_Roll_(singer)" title="Jelly Roll (singer)" id="mwMIs">Jelly Roll</a>, and more.<sup about="#mwt3787" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1022" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1022&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1022" id="mwMIw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMI0"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMI4">[</span>1022<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMI8">]</span></span></a></sup> The early 20s also saw the one-off return of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Beatles" title="The Beatles" id="mwMJA">the Beatles</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Rolling_Stones" title="The Rolling Stones" id="mwMJE">the Rolling Stones</a> with a new <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Now_and_Then_(Beatles_song)" title="Now and Then (Beatles song)" id="mwMJI">song</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hackney_Diamonds" title="Hackney Diamonds" id="mwMJM">album</a>, respectively, which topped out the charts immediately upon release.<sup about="#mwt3790" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1023" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1023&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1023" id="mwMJQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMJU"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMJY">[</span>1023<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMJc">]</span></span></a></sup> 2022 saw a revival in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kate_Bush" title="Kate Bush" id="mwMJg">Kate Bush</a>'s song "<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Running_Up_That_Hill" title="Running Up That Hill" id="mwMJk">Running Up That Hill</a>", due to its appearance in the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Netflix" title="Netflix" id="mwMJo">Netflix</a> series <i id="mwMJs"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stranger_Things" title="Stranger Things" id="mwMJw">Stranger Things</a></i>.<sup about="#mwt3793" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1024" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1024&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1024" id="mwMJ0"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMJ4"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMJ8">[</span>1024<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMKA">]</span></span></a></sup> Starting around 2023, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Country_music" title="Country music" id="mwMKE">country music</a> has seen a rise in popularity with artists such as <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Luke_Combs" title="Luke Combs" id="mwMKI">Luke Combs</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Morgan_Wallen" title="Morgan Wallen" id="mwMKM">Morgan Wallen</a> topping the charts along with artists such as <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beyoncé" title="Beyoncé" id="mwMKQ">Beyoncé</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Post_Malone" title="Post Malone" id="mwMKU">Post Malone</a> releasing country albums. </p><!--'''Most popular'''
