</section><section data-mw-section-id="60" id="mwMKY" aria-labelledby="Video_games"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Video_games">Video games</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=2020s&amp;action=edit&amp;section=60" title="Edit section: Video games"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt3794" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwMKc" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Main&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Main&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;2020s in video games&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1353705441" about="#mwt3795" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Hatnote/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}"></span><div role="note" class="hatnote navigation-not-searchable" about="#mwt3794" id="mwMKg">Main article: <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2020s_in_video_games" title="2020s in video games">2020s in video games</a></div>

<p id="mwMKk">The <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/History_of_video_game_consoles#Ninth_generation_(2020–present)" title="History of video game consoles" id="mwMKo">ninth generation</a> of consoles began in 2020. The industry remains dominated by <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nintendo" title="Nintendo" id="mwMKs">Nintendo</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sony" title="Sony" id="mwMKw">Sony</a>, and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Microsoft" title="Microsoft" id="mwMK0">Microsoft</a> with the release of the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xbox_Series_X/S" title="Xbox Series X/S" class="mw-redirect" id="mwMK4">Xbox Series X/S</a> and the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/PlayStation_5" title="PlayStation 5" id="mwMK8">PlayStation 5</a>, while the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nintendo_Switch" title="Nintendo Switch" id="mwMLA">Nintendo Switch</a> continues to be popular from the previous decade. Technological advancements in consoles included support for real-time <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ray_tracing_(graphics)" title="Ray tracing (graphics)" id="mwMLE">ray tracing graphics</a> and output for <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/4K_resolution" title="4K resolution" id="mwMLI">4K</a> or even <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/8K_resolution" title="8K resolution" id="mwMLM">8K resolution</a>. Physical media continued to be replaced by online distribution of games, with the Xbox Series S and the PlayStation 5 Digital Edition lacking an optical drive.<sup about="#mwt3796" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-Queen_13-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Queen&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-Queen-13" id="mwMLQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMLU"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMLY">[</span>13<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMLc">]</span></span></a></sup> The <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steam_Deck" title="Steam Deck" id="mwMLg">Steam Deck</a> was released in 2022 as <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Valve_Corporation" title="Valve Corporation" id="mwMLk">Valve</a>'s attempt to bring <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Personal_computer" title="Personal computer" id="mwMLo">PC</a>-level gaming to a Nintendo Switch-style handheld format.<sup about="#mwt3799" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1025" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1025&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1025" id="mwMLs"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMLw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwML0">[</span>1025<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwML4">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt3802" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1026" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1026&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1026" id="mwML8"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMMA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMME">[</span>1026<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMMI">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwMMM">During the decade <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/PC_game" title="PC game" id="mwMMQ">PC gaming</a> would continue growing rapidly with the console gaming market remaining more stagnant.<sup about="#mwt3805" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1027" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1027&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1027" id="mwMMU"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMMY"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMMc">[</span>1027<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMMg">]</span></span></a></sup> The growing majority of video game developers would also primarily focus on developing their projects for PC.<sup about="#mwt3808" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1028" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1028&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1028" id="mwMMk"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMMo"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMMs">[</span>1028<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMMw">]</span></span></a></sup> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mobile_gaming" title="Mobile gaming" class="mw-redirect" id="mwMM0">Mobile gaming</a> remained the largest sector of the video game industry during the decade, accounting for roughly half of the industry's revenue.<sup about="#mwt3811" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1029" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1029&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1029" id="mwMM4"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMM8"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMNA">[</span>1029<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMNE">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwMNI">Critically successful games such as <i id="mwMNM"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elden_Ring" title="Elden Ring" id="mwMNQ">Elden Ring</a></i>, <i id="mwMNU"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ghost_of_Tsushima" title="Ghost of Tsushima" id="mwMNY">Ghost of Tsushima</a></i>, <i id="mwMNc"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/God_of_War_Ragnarök" title="God of War Ragnarök" id="mwMNg">God of War Ragnarök</a></i>, <i id="mwMNk"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Baldur's_Gate_3" title="Baldur's Gate 3" id="mwMNo">Baldur's Gate 3</a></i>, <i id="mwMNs"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_Myth:_Wukong" title="Black Myth: Wukong" id="mwMNw">Black Myth: Wukong</a></i>, <i id="mwMN0"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Astro_Bot" title="Astro Bot" id="mwMN4">Astro Bot</a></i>, <i id="mwMN8"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clair_Obscur:_Expedition_33" title="Clair Obscur: Expedition 33" id="mwMOA">Clair Obscur: Expedition 33</a></i>, <i id="mwMOE"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cyberpunk_2077" title="Cyberpunk 2077" id="mwMOI">Cyberpunk 2077</a>,</i> and <i id="mwMOM"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Last_of_Us_Part_II" title="The Last of Us Part II" id="mwMOQ">The Last of Us Part II</a></i> were released and won multiple <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Game_of_the_Year_awards" title="List of Game of the Year awards" id="mwMOU">best game of the year awards</a>, signaling a shift towards narrative-driven and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Single-player_video_game" title="Single-player video game" id="mwMOY">single-played</a> focused gaming compared with the end of the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2010s_in_video_games" title="2010s in video games" id="mwMOc">2010s</a> where popularity of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Multiplayer_gaming" title="Multiplayer gaming" class="mw-redirect" id="mwMOg">multiplayer gaming</a> dominated.<sup about="#mwt3814" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1030" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1030&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1030" id="mwMOk"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMOo"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMOs">[</span>1030<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMOw">]</span></span></a></sup> Nonetheless, widely successful multiplayer games includes <i id="mwMO0"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Among_Us" title="Among Us" id="mwMO4">Among Us</a></i>, <i id="mwMO8"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/EA_Sports_FC" title="EA Sports FC" id="mwMPA">EA Sports FC</a></i>, <i id="mwMPE"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Call_of_Duty:_Warzone_(2020_video_game)" title="Call of Duty: Warzone (2020 video game)" id="mwMPI">Call of Duty: Warzone</a></i>, <i id="mwMPM"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fall_Guys" title="Fall Guys" id="mwMPQ">Fall Guys</a></i>, <i id="mwMPU"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fate/Grand_Order" title="Fate/Grand Order" id="mwMPY">Fate/Grand Order</a></i>, <i id="mwMPc"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fortnite" title="Fortnite" id="mwMPg">Fortnite</a></i>, <i id="mwMPk"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Genshin_Impact" title="Genshin Impact" id="mwMPo">Genshin Impact</a></i>, <i id="mwMPs"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Honkai:_Star_Rail" title="Honkai: Star Rail" id="mwMPw">Honkai: Star Rail</a></i>, <i id="mwMP0"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/It_Takes_Two_(video_game)" title="It Takes Two (video game)" id="mwMP4">It Takes Two</a></i>, <i id="mwMP8"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Counter-Strike_2" title="Counter-Strike 2" id="mwMQA">Counter-Strike 2</a></i>, <i id="mwMQE"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Umamusume:_Pretty_Derby" title="Umamusume: Pretty Derby" id="mwMQI">Umamusume: Pretty Derby</a></i>, <i id="mwMQM"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Minecraft" title="Minecraft" id="mwMQQ">Minecraft</a></i>, <i id="mwMQU"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Terraria" title="Terraria" id="mwMQY">Terraria</a></i>, <i id="mwMQc"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Roblox" title="Roblox" id="mwMQg">Roblox</a></i>, <i id="mwMQk"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tetris_Effect" title="Tetris Effect" id="mwMQo">Tetris Effect</a></i>, <i id="mwMQs"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dead_by_Daylight" title="Dead by Daylight" id="mwMQw">Dead by Daylight</a></i>, <i id="mwMQ0"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Overwatch_2" title="Overwatch 2" class="mw-redirect" id="mwMQ4">Overwatch 2</a></i>, <i id="mwMQ8"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/League_of_Legends" title="League of Legends" id="mwMRA">League of Legends</a></i>, and <i id="mwMRE"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Valorant" title="Valorant" id="mwMRI">Valorant</a></i> surged in popularity in the decade and became a global sensation since the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/COVID-19_pandemic" title="COVID-19 pandemic" id="mwMRM">COVID-19 pandemic</a>.<sup about="#mwt3815" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-unity_14-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;unity&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-unity-14" id="mwMRQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMRU"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMRY">[</span>14<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMRc">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="61" id="mwMRg" aria-labelledby="Architecture"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Architecture">Architecture</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=2020s&amp;action=edit&amp;section=61" title="Edit section: Architecture"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt3816" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwMRk" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Further&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Further&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Category:2020s architecture&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1353705441" about="#mwt3817" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Hatnote/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}"></span><div role="note" class="hatnote navigation-not-searchable" about="#mwt3816" id="mwMRo">Further information: <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Category:2020s_architecture" title="Category:2020s architecture">Category:2020s architecture</a></div>
<p id="mwMRs">There is a revival in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Expressionist_architecture" title="Expressionist architecture" id="mwMRw">expressionist architecture</a>. The <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SoFi_Stadium" title="SoFi Stadium" id="mwMR0">SoFi Stadium</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Intuit_Dome" title="Intuit Dome" id="mwMR4">Intuit Dome</a> were completed in September 2020 and August 2024, there are a component of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hollywood_Park_Racetrack" title="Hollywood Park Racetrack" id="mwMR8">Hollywood Park</a>, a master-planned neighborhood in development in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inglewood,_California" title="Inglewood, California" id="mwMSA">Inglewood, California</a>. The venue serves as a home to the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Los_Angeles_Clippers" title="Los Angeles Clippers" id="mwMSE">Los Angeles Clippers</a>, the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Los_Angeles_Rams" title="Los Angeles Rams" id="mwMSI">Rams</a>, and the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Los_Angeles_Chargers" title="Los Angeles Chargers" id="mwMSM">Chargers</a>. Both they hosted the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Super_Bowl_LVI" title="Super Bowl LVI" id="mwMSQ">Super Bowl LVI</a> in February 2022, the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_NBA_All-Star_Game" title="2026 NBA All-Star Game" id="mwMSU">2026 NBA All-Star Game</a> in February 2026, and the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_FIFA_World_Cup" title="2026 FIFA World Cup" id="mwMSY">2026 FIFA World Cup</a> in June 2026.<sup about="#mwt3820" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1031" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1031&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1031" id="mwMSc"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMSg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMSk">[</span>1031<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMSo">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt3823" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1032" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1032&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1032" id="mwMSs"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMSw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMS0">[</span>1032<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMS4">]</span></span></a></sup> The stadium and arena is also set to host the opening and closing ceremonies, aquatic events (swimming and diving), and basketball events for the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2028_Summer_Olympics" title="2028 Summer Olympics" id="mwMS8">2028 Summer Olympics</a>, which will be hosted in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Los_Angeles" title="Los Angeles" id="mwMTA">Los Angeles, California</a>, United States.<sup about="#mwt3826" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1033" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1033&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1033" id="mwMTE"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMTI"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMTM">[</span>1033<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMTQ">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwMTU">The developments in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Port_Melbourne" title="Port Melbourne" id="mwMTY">Port Melbourne</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Victoria_(state)" title="Victoria (state)" id="mwMTc">Victoria</a> of the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/West_Gate_Tunnel" title="West Gate Tunnel" id="mwMTg">West Gate Tunnel</a> continued from 2020, which is designed to provide an alternative to the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/West_Gate_Bridge" title="West Gate Bridge" id="mwMTk">West Gate Bridge</a>, it is expected to be completed in 2025.<sup about="#mwt3829" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1034" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1034&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1034" id="mwMTo"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMTs"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMTw">[</span>1034<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMT0">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt3832" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1035" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1035&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1035" id="mwMT4"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMT8"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMUA">[</span>1035<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMUE">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwMUI">The <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Unity_Tower" title="Unity Tower" id="mwMUM">Unity Tower</a> in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kraków" title="Kraków" id="mwMUQ">Kraków</a> was finally completed on 30 September 2020. The construction of the building originally started in 1975 but stopped permanently in 1981 because of economic constraints and political unrest at the time. Due to the unfinished building's resemblance to a <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Skeleton" title="Skeleton" id="mwMUU">skeleton</a>, it was nicknamed after <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Skeletor" title="Skeletor" id="mwMUY">Skeletor</a>, the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arch-villain" title="Arch-villain" class="mw-redirect" id="mwMUc">arch-villain</a> in <i id="mwMUg"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/He-Man_and_the_Masters_of_the_Universe" title="He-Man and the Masters of the Universe" id="mwMUk">He-Man and the Masters of the Universe</a></i>, which was popular in Poland at the time construction began.<sup about="#mwt3835" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1036" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1036&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1036" id="mwMUo"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMUs"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMUw">[</span>1036<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMU0">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwMU4">Several developments in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saudi_Arabia" title="Saudi Arabia" id="mwMU8">Saudi Arabia</a> to achieve the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saudi_Vision_2030" title="Saudi Vision 2030" id="mwMVA">Saudi Vision 2030</a>, such as the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2034_FIFA_World_Cup" title="2034 FIFA World Cup" id="mwMVE">2034 FIFA World Cup</a> stadiums, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Qiddiya_City" title="Qiddiya City" id="mwMVI">Qiddiya City</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neom" title="Neom" id="mwMVM">Neom</a>'s <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Line,_Saudi_Arabia" title="The Line, Saudi Arabia" id="mwMVQ">The Line</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jeddah_Tower" title="Jeddah Tower" id="mwMVU">Jeddah Tower</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Roshn" title="Roshn" id="mwMVY">Roshn</a>, and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Riyadh" title="Riyadh" id="mwMVc">Riyadh</a>'s <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Expo_2030" title="Expo 2030" id="mwMVg">Expo 2030</a> site.<sup about="#mwt3839" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1037" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1037&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1037" id="mwMVk"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMVo"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMVs">[</span>1037<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMVw">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt3842" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1038" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1038&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1038" id="mwMV0"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMV4"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMV8">[</span>1038<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMWA">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt3845" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1039" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1039&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1039" id="mwMWE"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMWI"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMWM">[</span>1039<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMWQ">]</span></span></a></sup> The Jeddah Tower would become the world's <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/History_of_the_world's_tallest_structures" title="History of the world's tallest structures" id="mwMWU">tallest building or structure</a>, after a long-delayed construction progress and resumed in 2025, standing at least <span about="#mwt3836" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwMWY" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;convert&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Convert&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;180&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;m&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;ft&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}">180 metres (590</span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt3836">&nbsp;</span><span about="#mwt3836">ft)</span> taller than the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Burj_Khalifa" title="Burj Khalifa" id="mwMWc">Burj Khalifa</a>.<sup about="#mwt3848" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1040" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1040&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1040" id="mwMWg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMWk"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMWo">[</span>1040<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMWs">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt3851" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1041" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1041&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1041" id="mwMWw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMW0"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMW4">[</span>1041<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMW8">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwMXA">The Grand Ring was built and designed by the Japanese firms Tohata Architects and Azusa Sekkei, the building became the symbol of the famous <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Expo_2025" title="Expo 2025" id="mwMXE">Expo 2025</a> in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Osaka" title="Osaka" id="mwMXI">Osaka</a>, Japan.<sup about="#mwt3854" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-:1_1042-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;:1&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-:1-1042&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-:1-1042" id="mwMXM"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMXQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMXU">[</span>1042<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMXY">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt3857" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1043" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1043&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1043" id="mwMXc"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMXg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMXk">[</span>1043<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMXo">]</span></span></a></sup> It was recognized by the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Guinness_World_Records" title="Guinness World Records" id="mwMXs">Guinness World Records</a> as the world's largest architectural structure (certified area: 61,035.55 m<sup id="mwMXw">2</sup>).<sup about="#mwt3860" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1044" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1044&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1044" id="mwMX0"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMX4"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMX8">[</span>1044<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMYA">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt3863" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1045" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1045&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1045" id="mwMYE"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMYI"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMYM">[</span>1045<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMYQ">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt3864" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-:1_1042-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;:1&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-:1-1042" id="mwMYU"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMYY"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMYc">[</span>1042<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMYg">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt3867" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1046" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1046&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1046" id="mwMYk"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMYo"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMYs">[</span>1046<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMYw">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt3870" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1047" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1047&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1047" id="mwMY0"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMY4"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMY8">[</span>1047<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMZA">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwMZE">Between October 2025 and February 2026, the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sagrada_Família" title="Sagrada Família" id="mwMZI">Sagrada Família</a> became <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_tallest_church_buildings" title="List of tallest church buildings" id="mwMZM">the world's tallest church</a> when a part of its central tower was lifted into place and reached 162.91 m, surpassing <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ulm_Minster" title="Ulm Minster" id="mwMZQ">Ulm Minster</a> (161.53 m),<sup about="#mwt3874" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1048" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1048&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1048" id="mwMZU"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMZY"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMZc">[</span>1048<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMZg">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt3877" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1049" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1049&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1049" id="mwMZk"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMZo"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMZs">[</span>1049<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMZw">]</span></span></a></sup> and the cathedral reached its final height of <span about="#mwt3871" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwMZ0" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;convert&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Convert&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;172.5&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;m&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}">172.5 metres (566</span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt3871">&nbsp;</span><span about="#mwt3871">ft)</span>.<sup about="#mwt3880" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1050" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1050&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1050" id="mwMZ4"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMZ8"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMaA">[</span>1050<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMaE">]</span></span></a></sup> The cathedral also became the longest period of construction history since 1882, and reached its maximum height though the magnum opus of Catalan architect <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Antoni_Gaudí" title="Antoni Gaudí" id="mwMaI">Antoni Gaudí</a>'s legacy remains years away from completion.<sup about="#mwt3883" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1051" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1051&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1051" id="mwMaM"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMaQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMaU">[</span>1051<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMaY">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="62" id="mwMac" aria-labelledby="Sports"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Sports">Sports</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=2020s&amp;action=edit&amp;section=62" title="Edit section: Sports"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwMag">Since the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/COVID-19_pandemic" title="COVID-19 pandemic" id="mwMak">COVID-19 pandemic</a> impacted major sporting events led to the postponement and cancellations in the early-2020s, technological advances growing popularity throughout the decade like digital live broadcasts from the successful <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2024_Summer_Olympics" title="2024 Summer Olympics" id="mwMao">2024 Summer Olympics</a> in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paris" title="Paris" id="mwMas">Paris</a>. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Association_football" title="Association football" id="mwMaw">Football</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Horse_racing" title="Horse racing" id="mwMa0">horse racing</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Basketball" title="Basketball" id="mwMa4">basketball</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sport_of_athletics" title="Sport of athletics" id="mwMa8">athletics</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tennis" title="Tennis" id="mwMbA">tennis</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Volleyball" title="Volleyball" id="mwMbE">volleyball</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Baseball" title="Baseball" id="mwMbI">baseball</a>, and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cricket" title="Cricket" id="mwMbM">cricket</a> became more popular for digital audiences during the decade.<sup about="#mwt3886" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1052" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1052&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1052" id="mwMbQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMbU"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMbY">[</span>1052<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMbc">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwMbg">The COVID-19 pandemic led to the cancellation or rescheduling of numerous sporting events globally. The <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2020_Summer_Olympics" title="2020 Summer Olympics" id="mwMbk">2020 Summer Olympics</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2020_Summer_Paralympics" title="2020 Summer Paralympics" id="mwMbo">Paralympics</a> in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo" title="Tokyo" id="mwMbs">Tokyo</a> were postponed to July–August 2021. This was the first Olympic Games to be postponed rather than cancelled in history since World War II.<sup about="#mwt3889" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1053" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1053&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1053" id="mwMbw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMb0"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMb4">[</span>1053<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMb8">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwMcA">Zimbabwean sports administrator and politician <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kirsty_Coventry" title="Kirsty Coventry" id="mwMcE">Kirsty Coventry</a> became the first woman, the first multicultural, and the first African <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/President_of_the_International_Olympic_Committee" title="President of the International Olympic Committee" id="mwMcI">President of the International Olympic Committee</a>, following the resignation of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thomas_Bach" title="Thomas Bach" id="mwMcM">Thomas Bach</a>.<sup about="#mwt3892" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1054" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1054&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1054" id="mwMcQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMcU"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMcY">[</span>1054<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMcc">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt3895" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1055" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1055&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1055" id="mwMcg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMck"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMco">[</span>1055<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMcs">]</span></span></a></sup> She is also the second youngest person and second Olympic medallist to be elected to the position since <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pierre_de_Coubertin" title="Pierre de Coubertin" id="mwMcw">Pierre de Coubertin</a> and Thomas Bach, her achievements are focused on <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Feminism" title="Feminism" id="mwMc0">feminism</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gender_equality" title="Gender equality" id="mwMc4">gender equality</a> in sports.</p>

<p id="mwMc8">The International Olympic Committee has begun a new policy of authorizing up to 5 additional sports per edition of the Olympic Games, and this rule applies to both the Summer and Winter Games. This rule came into effect starting with the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2020_Summer_Olympics" title="2020 Summer Olympics" id="mwMdA">2020 Summer Olympics</a>.<sup about="#mwt3898" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1056" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1056&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1056" id="mwMdE"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMdI"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMdM">[</span>1056<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMdQ">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<section data-mw-section-id="63" id="mwMdU" aria-labelledby="Football"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading4"><h4 id="Football">Football</h4><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=2020s&amp;action=edit&amp;section=63" title="Edit section: Football"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt3899" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwMdY" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:multiple image&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;\n&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; align             = right\n&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; image1            = Lionel Messi 20180626.jpg\n&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; width1            = 145\n&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; alt1              = Lionel Messi\n&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; caption1          = \n&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; image2            = 2022 FIFA World Cup France 4–1 Australia - (8).jpg\n&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; width2            = 173\n&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; alt2              = Kylian Mbappé\n&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; caption2          = \n&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; footer_align      = center\n&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; footer            = Argentine and French [[footballer]]s [[Lionel Messi]] and [[Kylian Mbappé]] was voted as the [[FIFA World Cup awards#Golden Ball|Golden Ball]] and the [[FIFA World Cup awards#Golden Boot|Golden Boot]] of the [[2022 FIFA World Cup]]\n&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1349637415/mw-parser-output/.tmulti" about="#mwt3900" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Multiple image/styles.css&quot;,&quot;wrapper&quot;:&quot;.tmulti&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}"></span><div class="thumb tmulti floatright" about="#mwt3899" id="mwMdc"><div class="thumbinner multiimageinner" style="width:326px;max-width:326px"><div class="trow"><div class="tsingle" style="width:147px;max-width:147px"><div class="thumbimage"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Lionel_Messi_20180626.jpg" class="mw-file-description"><img alt="Lionel Messi" resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Lionel_Messi_20180626.jpg" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c1/Lionel_Messi_20180626.jpg/250px-Lionel_Messi_20180626.jpg" decoding="async" data-file-width="701" data-file-height="1000" data-file-type="bitmap" height="207" width="145" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c1/Lionel_Messi_20180626.jpg/330px-Lionel_Messi_20180626.jpg 2x" class="mw-file-element"></a></span></div></div><div class="tsingle" style="width:175px;max-width:175px"><div class="thumbimage"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:2022_FIFA_World_Cup_France_4–1_Australia_-_(8).jpg" class="mw-file-description"><img alt="Kylian Mbappé" resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:2022_FIFA_World_Cup_France_4–1_Australia_-_(8).jpg" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/2022_FIFA_World_Cup_France_4%E2%80%931_Australia_-_%288%29.jpg/250px-2022_FIFA_World_Cup_France_4%E2%80%931_Australia_-_%288%29.jpg" decoding="async" data-file-width="409" data-file-height="491" data-file-type="bitmap" height="208" width="173" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a4/2022_FIFA_World_Cup_France_4%E2%80%931_Australia_-_%288%29.jpg 2x" class="mw-file-element"></a></span></div></div></div><div class="trow" style="display:flow-root"><div class="thumbcaption" style="text-align:center">Argentine and French <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Footballer" title="Footballer" class="mw-redirect">footballers</a> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lionel_Messi" title="Lionel Messi">Lionel Messi</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kylian_Mbappé" title="Kylian Mbappé">Kylian Mbappé</a> was voted as the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/FIFA_World_Cup_awards#Golden_Ball" title="FIFA World Cup awards">Golden Ball</a> and the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/FIFA_World_Cup_awards#Golden_Boot" title="FIFA World Cup awards">Golden Boot</a> of the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022_FIFA_World_Cup" title="2022 FIFA World Cup">2022 FIFA World Cup</a></div></div></div></div>

<p id="mwMdg">Football's popularity has continued global dominance, while also undergoing significant shifts due to various factors, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Argentina_national_football_team" title="Argentina national football team" id="mwMdk">Argentina</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spain_women's_national_football_team" title="Spain women's national football team" id="mwMdo">Spain</a> won the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022_FIFA_World_Cup" title="2022 FIFA World Cup" id="mwMds">2022 FIFA World Cup</a> and the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2023_FIFA_Women's_World_Cup" title="2023 FIFA Women's World Cup" id="mwMdw">2023 FIFA Women's World Cup</a> by defeating <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/France_national_football_team" title="France national football team" id="mwMd0">France</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/England_women's_national_football_team" title="England women's national football team" id="mwMd4">England</a>,<sup about="#mwt3903" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1057" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1057&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1057" id="mwMd8"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMeA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMeE">[</span>1057<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMeI">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt3906" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1058" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1058&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1058" id="mwMeM"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMeQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMeU">[</span>1058<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMeY">]</span></span></a></sup> with <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lionel_Messi" title="Lionel Messi" id="mwMec">Lionel Messi</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aitana_Bonmatí" title="Aitana Bonmatí" id="mwMeg">Aitana Bonmatí</a> winning the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/FIFA_World_Cup_awards#Golden_Ball" title="FIFA World Cup awards" id="mwMek">Golden Balls</a>,<sup about="#mwt3909" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1059" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1059&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1059" id="mwMeo"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMes"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMew">[</span>1059<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMe0">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt3912" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1060" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1060&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1060" id="mwMe4"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMe8"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMfA">[</span>1060<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMfE">]</span></span></a></sup> while <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hinata_Miyazawa" title="Hinata Miyazawa" id="mwMfI">Hinata Miyazawa</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kylian_Mbappé" title="Kylian Mbappé" id="mwMfM">Kylian Mbappé</a> winning the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/FIFA_World_Cup_awards#Golden_Boot" title="FIFA World Cup awards" id="mwMfQ">Golden Boots</a>.<sup about="#mwt3915" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1061" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1061&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1061" id="mwMfU"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMfY"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMfc">[</span>1061<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMfg">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt3918" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1062" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1062&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1062" id="mwMfk"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMfo"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMfs">[</span>1062<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMfw">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwMf0">The <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_FIFA_World_Cup" title="2026 FIFA World Cup" id="mwMf4">2026 FIFA World Cup</a> was the first since <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2002_FIFA_World_Cup" title="2002 FIFA World Cup" id="mwMf8">2002</a> to be hosted by multiple nations. Mexico became the first country to host the World Cup three times, having hosted the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1970_FIFA_World_Cup" title="1970 FIFA World Cup" id="mwMgA">1970</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1986_FIFA_World_Cup" title="1986 FIFA World Cup" id="mwMgE">1986</a> tournaments.<sup about="#mwt3921" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-:04_1063-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;:04&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-:04-1063&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-:04-1063" id="mwMgI"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMgM"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMgQ">[</span>1063<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMgU">]</span></span></a></sup> The United States previously hosted the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1994_FIFA_World_Cup" title="1994 FIFA World Cup" id="mwMgY">World Cup in 1994</a>, while it was Canada's first time hosting the tournament. Spain won the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_FIFA_World_Cup_final" title="2026 FIFA World Cup final" id="mwMgc">finals</a> over Argentina and returned to football domination of victories at the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/UEFA_Euro_2024" title="UEFA Euro 2024" id="mwMgg">UEFA Euro 2024</a> and the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Football_at_the_2024_Summer_Olympics" title="Football at the 2024 Summer Olympics" id="mwMgk">Paris 2024 Olympic football matches</a>, it was their second <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/FIFA_World_Cup" title="FIFA World Cup" id="mwMgo">FIFA World Cup</a> title and first World Cup victory since <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2010_FIFA_World_Cup_final" title="2010 FIFA World Cup final" id="mwMgs">2010</a>.<sup about="#mwt3924" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1064" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1064&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1064" id="mwMgw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMg0"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMg4">[</span>1064<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMg8">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt3927" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1065" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1065&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1065" id="mwMhA"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMhE"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMhI">[</span>1065<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMhM">]</span></span></a></sup> Spain became the first country to simultaneously hold the men's and women's World Cup, having won the latter in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2023_FIFA_Women's_World_Cup" title="2023 FIFA Women's World Cup" id="mwMhQ">2023</a>.<sup about="#mwt3930" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1066" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1066&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1066" id="mwMhU"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMhY"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMhc">[</span>1066<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMhg">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="64" id="mwMhk" aria-labelledby="Baseball"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading4"><h4 id="Baseball">Baseball</h4><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=2020s&amp;action=edit&amp;section=64" title="Edit section: Baseball"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt3931" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwMho" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:multiple image&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;\n&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; align             = right\n&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; image1            = Dodgers at Nationals (53677192000) (cropped).jpg\n&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; width1            = 145\n&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; alt1              = Shohei Otani\n&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; caption1          = \n&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; image2            = Aaron Judge 2018.jpg\n&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; width2            = 175\n&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; alt2              = Aaron Judge\n&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; caption2          = \n&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; footer_align      = center\n&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; footer            = [[Major League Baseball|MLB]] players like [[Shohei Otani]] of the [[Los Angeles Dodgers|Dodgers]] and [[Aaron Judge]] of the [[New York Yankees|Yankees]] are the first player in MLB history to record [[40–40 club#50–50 season|50 home runs and stolen bases]] and a six-time [[Major League Baseball All-Star Game|MLB All-Star]] MVP winner, followed by the Dodgers victory at the [[2024 World Series]], and again in [[2025 World Series|2025]] over [[Toronto Blue Jays]]\n&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1349637415/mw-parser-output/.tmulti" about="#mwt3932" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Multiple image/styles.css&quot;,&quot;wrapper&quot;:&quot;.tmulti&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}"></span><div class="thumb tmulti floatright" about="#mwt3931" id="mwMhs"><div class="thumbinner multiimageinner" style="width:328px;max-width:328px"><div class="trow"><div class="tsingle" style="width:147px;max-width:147px"><div class="thumbimage"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Dodgers_at_Nationals_(53677192000)_(cropped).jpg" class="mw-file-description"><img alt="Shohei Otani" resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Dodgers_at_Nationals_(53677192000)_(cropped).jpg" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e6/Dodgers_at_Nationals_%2853677192000%29_%28cropped%29.jpg/250px-Dodgers_at_Nationals_%2853677192000%29_%28cropped%29.jpg" decoding="async" data-file-width="1667" data-file-height="2145" data-file-type="bitmap" height="187" width="145" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e6/Dodgers_at_Nationals_%2853677192000%29_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Dodgers_at_Nationals_%2853677192000%29_%28cropped%29.jpg 2x" class="mw-file-element"></a></span></div></div><div class="tsingle" style="width:177px;max-width:177px"><div class="thumbimage"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Aaron_Judge_2018.jpg" class="mw-file-description"><img alt="Aaron Judge" resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Aaron_Judge_2018.jpg" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a6/Aaron_Judge_2018.jpg/250px-Aaron_Judge_2018.jpg" decoding="async" data-file-width="2955" data-file-height="3175" data-file-type="bitmap" height="188" width="175" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a6/Aaron_Judge_2018.jpg/500px-Aaron_Judge_2018.jpg 2x" class="mw-file-element"></a></span></div></div></div><div class="trow" style="display:flow-root"><div class="thumbcaption" style="text-align:center"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Major_League_Baseball" title="Major League Baseball">MLB</a> players like <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shohei_Otani" title="Shohei Otani" class="mw-redirect">Shohei Otani</a> of the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Los_Angeles_Dodgers" title="Los Angeles Dodgers">Dodgers</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aaron_Judge" title="Aaron Judge">Aaron Judge</a> of the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/New_York_Yankees" title="New York Yankees">Yankees</a> are the first player in MLB history to record <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/40–40_club#50–50_season" title="40–40 club">50 home runs and stolen bases</a> and a six-time <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Major_League_Baseball_All-Star_Game" title="Major League Baseball All-Star Game">MLB All-Star</a> MVP winner, followed by the Dodgers victory at the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2024_World_Series" title="2024 World Series">2024 World Series</a>, and again in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2025_World_Series" title="2025 World Series">2025</a> over <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Toronto_Blue_Jays" title="Toronto Blue Jays">Toronto Blue Jays</a></div></div></div></div>

<p id="mwMhw">Baseball had a notable resurgence, particularly within its traditional strongholds, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Japan" title="Japan" id="mwMh0">Japan</a> and the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States" title="United States" id="mwMh4">United States</a>. Japan defeated the United States in the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2023_World_Baseball_Classic" title="2023 World Baseball Classic" id="mwMh8">2023 World Baseball Classic</a> with a score of 3–2, winning their 3rd title in the event.<sup about="#mwt3935" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1067" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1067&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1067" id="mwMiA"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMiE"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMiI">[</span>1067<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMiM">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt3938" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-Imperialism_at_the_World_Baseball_Classic_1068-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Imperialism at the World Baseball Classic&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-Imperialism_at_the_World_Baseball_Classic-1068&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-Imperialism_at_the_World_Baseball_Classic-1068" id="mwMiQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMiU"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMiY">[</span>1068<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMic">]</span></span></a></sup> Japanese baseball player <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shohei_Ohtani" title="Shohei Ohtani" id="mwMig">Shohei Ohtani</a> was named the MVP of the tournament. He became the first player in MLB history to record <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/40–40_club#50–50_season" title="40–40 club" id="mwMik">50 home runs and 50 stolen bases</a> in a season and was unanimously named the 2024 <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/National_League_(baseball)" title="National League (baseball)" id="mwMio">National League</a> MVP. Rivaling <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aaron_Judge" title="Aaron Judge" id="mwMis">Aaron Judge</a> of the New York <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/New_York_Yankees" title="New York Yankees" id="mwMiw">Yankees</a>, Ohtani led the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Los_Angeles" title="Los Angeles" id="mwMi0">Los Angeles</a> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Los_Angeles_Dodgers" title="Los Angeles Dodgers" id="mwMi4">Dodgers</a> to victory in the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2024_World_Series" title="2024 World Series" id="mwMi8">2024 World Series</a>, and again in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2025_World_Series" title="2025 World Series" id="mwMjA">2025</a> over <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Toronto_Blue_Jays" title="Toronto Blue Jays" id="mwMjE">Toronto Blue Jays</a>.<sup about="#mwt3941" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1069" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1069&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1069" id="mwMjI"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMjM"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMjQ">[</span>1069<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMjU">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt3944" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1070" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1070&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1070" id="mwMjY"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMjc"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMjg">[</span>1070<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMjk">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt3947" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1071" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1071&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1071" id="mwMjo"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMjs"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMjw">[</span>1071<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMj0">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwMj4"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Venezuela_national_baseball_team" title="Venezuela national baseball team" id="mwMj8">Venezuela</a> had landslide victories over Japan and Italy in the quarterfinal and semifinal and won this year's World Baseball Classic tournament, beating the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States_national_baseball_team" title="United States national baseball team" id="mwMkA">United States</a> 3–2 in the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_World_Baseball_Classic_championship" title="2026 World Baseball Classic championship" id="mwMkE">2026 World Baseball Classic championship</a>, with <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eugenio_Suarez" title="Eugenio Suarez" class="mw-redirect" id="mwMkI">Eugenio Suarez</a> hitting a go-ahead double in the top of the 9th to clinch their first title. It was the first major international sporting competition won by Venezuela since the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1945_Amateur_World_Series" title="1945 Amateur World Series" id="mwMkM">1945 Amateur World Series</a>, and the second time in Latin America since <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2013_World_Baseball_Classic" title="2013 World Baseball Classic" id="mwMkQ">2013</a>.<sup about="#mwt3950" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1072" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1072&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1072" id="mwMkU"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMkY"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMkc">[</span>1072<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMkg">]</span></span></a></sup> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maikel_García" title="Maikel García" id="mwMkk">Maikel García</a> of Venezuela was named the MVP of the tournament.<sup about="#mwt3953" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1073" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1073&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1073" id="mwMko"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMks"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMkw">[</span>1073<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMk0">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwMk4">The tournament has hit new high levels in attendance and US Television viewership: the 2023 attendance record was broken before the pool play was ended, and US viewership of the final hit 10 million viewers for the first time ever.<sup about="#mwt3956" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1074" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1074&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1074" id="mwMk8"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMlA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMlE">[</span>1074<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMlI">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt3959" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1075" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1075&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1075" id="mwMlM"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMlQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMlU">[</span>1075<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMlY">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwMlc"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shohei_Otani" title="Shohei Otani" class="mw-redirect" id="mwMlg">Shohei Otani</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mookie_Betts" title="Mookie Betts" id="mwMlk">Mookie Betts</a> met with <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/President_of_the_United_States" title="President of the United States" id="mwMlo">US president</a> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Donald_Trump" title="Donald Trump" id="mwMls">Donald Trump</a> at the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/White_House" title="White House" id="mwMlw">White House</a> in April 2025.<sup about="#mwt3962" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1076" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1076&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1076" id="mwMl0"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMl4"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMl8">[</span>1076<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMmA">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="65" id="mwMmE" aria-labelledby="Basketball"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading4"><h4 id="Basketball">Basketball</h4><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=2020s&amp;action=edit&amp;section=65" title="Edit section: Basketball"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt3963" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwMmI" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:multiple image&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;\n&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; align             = right\n&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; image1            = Giannis Antetokounmpo (24845003687) (cropped).jpg\n&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; width1            = 163\n&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; alt1              = Giannis Antetokounmpo\n&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; caption1          = \n&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; image2            = Nikola Jokic free throw (cropped).jpg\n&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; width2            = 155\n&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; alt2              = Nikola Jokic\n&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; caption2          = \n&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; image3            = Shai Gilgeous-Alexander - Thunder vs. Wizards.png\n&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; width3            = 178\n&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; alt3              = Shai Gilgeous-Alexander\n&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; caption3          = \n&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; footer_align      = center\n&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; footer            = [[Giannis Antetokounmpo]], [[Nikola Jokić]] and [[Shai Gilgeous-Alexander]] won [[NBA Finals Most Valuable Player|Finals MVP]]s during the decade, playing for the [[Milwaukee Bucks]] ([[2020-21 Milwaukee Bucks season|2021]]), the [[Denver Nuggets]] ([[2022-23 Denver Nuggets season|2023]]), and the [[Oklahoma City Thunder]] ([[2024-25 Oklahoma City Thunder season|2025]]) respectively\n&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1349637415/mw-parser-output/.tmulti" about="#mwt3964" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Multiple image/styles.css&quot;,&quot;wrapper&quot;:&quot;.tmulti&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}"></span><div class="thumb tmulti floatright" about="#mwt3963" id="mwMmM"><div class="thumbinner multiimageinner" style="width:508px;max-width:508px"><div class="trow"><div class="tsingle" style="width:165px;max-width:165px"><div class="thumbimage"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Giannis_Antetokounmpo_(24845003687)_(cropped).jpg" class="mw-file-description"><img alt="Giannis Antetokounmpo" resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Giannis_Antetokounmpo_(24845003687)_(cropped).jpg" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7c/Giannis_Antetokounmpo_%2824845003687%29_%28cropped%29.jpg/250px-Giannis_Antetokounmpo_%2824845003687%29_%28cropped%29.jpg" decoding="async" data-file-width="2199" data-file-height="2839" data-file-type="bitmap" height="210" width="163" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7c/Giannis_Antetokounmpo_%2824845003687%29_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Giannis_Antetokounmpo_%2824845003687%29_%28cropped%29.jpg 2x" class="mw-file-element"></a></span></div></div><div class="tsingle" style="width:157px;max-width:157px"><div class="thumbimage"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Nikola_Jokic_free_throw_(cropped).jpg" class="mw-file-description"><img alt="Nikola Jokic" resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Nikola_Jokic_free_throw_(cropped).jpg" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7e/Nikola_Jokic_free_throw_%28cropped%29.jpg/250px-Nikola_Jokic_free_throw_%28cropped%29.jpg" decoding="async" data-file-width="948" data-file-height="1291" data-file-type="bitmap" height="211" width="155" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7e/Nikola_Jokic_free_throw_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Nikola_Jokic_free_throw_%28cropped%29.jpg 2x" class="mw-file-element"></a></span></div></div><div class="tsingle" style="width:180px;max-width:180px"><div class="thumbimage"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Shai_Gilgeous-Alexander_-_Thunder_vs._Wizards.png" class="mw-file-description"><img alt="Shai Gilgeous-Alexander" resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Shai_Gilgeous-Alexander_-_Thunder_vs._Wizards.png" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c6/Shai_Gilgeous-Alexander_-_Thunder_vs._Wizards.png/250px-Shai_Gilgeous-Alexander_-_Thunder_vs._Wizards.png" decoding="async" data-file-width="724" data-file-height="863" data-file-type="bitmap" height="212" width="178" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c6/Shai_Gilgeous-Alexander_-_Thunder_vs._Wizards.png/500px-Shai_Gilgeous-Alexander_-_Thunder_vs._Wizards.png 2x" class="mw-file-element"></a></span></div></div></div><div class="trow" style="display:flow-root"><div class="thumbcaption" style="text-align:center"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Giannis_Antetokounmpo" title="Giannis Antetokounmpo">Giannis Antetokounmpo</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nikola_Jokić" title="Nikola Jokić">Nikola Jokić</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shai_Gilgeous-Alexander" title="Shai Gilgeous-Alexander">Shai Gilgeous-Alexander</a> won <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/NBA_Finals_Most_Valuable_Player" title="NBA Finals Most Valuable Player">Finals MVPs</a> during the decade, playing for the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Milwaukee_Bucks" title="Milwaukee Bucks">Milwaukee Bucks</a> (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2020-21_Milwaukee_Bucks_season" title="2020-21 Milwaukee Bucks season" class="mw-redirect">2021</a>), the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Denver_Nuggets" title="Denver Nuggets">Denver Nuggets</a> (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022-23_Denver_Nuggets_season" title="2022-23 Denver Nuggets season" class="mw-redirect">2023</a>), and the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oklahoma_City_Thunder" title="Oklahoma City Thunder">Oklahoma City Thunder</a> (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2024-25_Oklahoma_City_Thunder_season" title="2024-25 Oklahoma City Thunder season" class="mw-redirect">2025</a>) respectively</div></div></div></div>

<p id="mwMmQ">Shortly into the decade, on January 26, 2020, 5-time NBA champion, 2008 <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/NBA_Most_Valuable_Player" title="NBA Most Valuable Player" id="mwMmU">NBA MVP</a>, two-time Olympic gold medallist and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Los_Angeles_Lakers" title="Los Angeles Lakers" id="mwMmY">Los Angeles Lakers</a> great <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kobe_Bryant" title="Kobe Bryant" id="mwMmc">Kobe Bryant</a>, and his 13-year-old daughter <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gianna_Bryant" title="Gianna Bryant" id="mwMmg">Gianna</a>, died in a <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2020_Calabasas_helicopter_crash" title="2020 Calabasas helicopter crash" id="mwMmk">California helicopter crash</a> along with seven other people.<sup about="#mwt3967" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-9_on_board_1077-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;9 on board&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-9_on_board-1077&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-9_on_board-1077" id="mwMmo"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMms"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMmw">[</span>1077<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMm0">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt3970" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-Death-CNBC_1078-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Death-CNBC&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-Death-CNBC-1078&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-Death-CNBC-1078" id="mwMm4"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMm8"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMnA">[</span>1078<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMnE">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt3973" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-Alfonso2020_1079-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Alfonso2020&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-Alfonso2020-1079&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-Alfonso2020-1079" id="mwMnI"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMnM"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMnQ">[</span>1079<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMnU">]</span></span></a></sup> A number of tributes and memorials subsequently followed, and the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/NBA_All-Star_Game_Most_Valuable_Player" title="NBA All-Star Game Most Valuable Player" id="mwMnY">All-Star Game MVP Award</a> was renamed in Bryant's honour.<sup about="#mwt3976" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1080" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1080&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1080" id="mwMnc"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMng"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMnk">[</span>1080<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMno">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwMns">Basketball has been characterized by significant global growth and dominance in strong youth engagement, the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2023_FIBA_Basketball_World_Cup" title="2023 FIBA Basketball World Cup" id="mwMnw">2023 FIBA World Cup</a> followed by <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Germany_men's_national_basketball_team" title="Germany men's national basketball team" id="mwMn0">Germany</a> won by defeating <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Serbia_men's_national_basketball_team" title="Serbia men's national basketball team" id="mwMn4">Serbia</a>.<sup about="#mwt3979" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1081" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1081&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1081" id="mwMn8"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMoA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMoE">[</span>1081<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMoI">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwMoM">On February 7, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022-23_NBA_season" title="2022-23 NBA season" class="mw-redirect" id="mwMoQ">2023</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/LeBron_James" title="LeBron James" id="mwMoU">LeBron James</a>, playing for the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Los_Angeles_Lakers" title="Los Angeles Lakers" id="mwMoY">Los Angeles Lakers</a>, scored his 38,388th career point in a game against the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oklahoma_City_Thunder" title="Oklahoma City Thunder" id="mwMoc">Oklahoma City Thunder</a>, surpassing <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kareem_Abdul-Jabbar" title="Kareem Abdul-Jabbar" id="mwMog">Kareem Abdul-Jabbar</a> to become the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_National_Basketball_Association_career_scoring_leaders" title="List of National Basketball Association career scoring leaders" class="mw-redirect" id="mwMok">all-time leading scorer</a> in NBA history.<link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:All_articles_with_unsourced_statements" about="#mwt3980" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwMoo" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Citation needed&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Citation_needed&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;date&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;April 2026&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_with_unsourced_statements_from_April_2026" about="#mwt3980"><sup class="noprint Inline-Template Template-Fact" style="white-space:nowrap;" about="#mwt3980" id="mwMos"><span typeof="mw:Entity">[</span><i><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Citation_needed" title="Wikipedia:Citation needed"><span title="This claim needs references to reliable sources. (April 2026)">citation needed</span></a></i><span typeof="mw:Entity">]</span></sup></p>

<p id="mwMow">On the night of February 1–2, 2025, Luka Dončić was traded from the Dallas Mavericks to the Los Angeles Lakers for Anthony Davis in a three-team deal facilitated by the Utah Jazz.<sup about="#mwt3983" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1082" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1082&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1082" id="mwMo0"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMo4"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMo8">[</span>1082<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMpA">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

</section></section><section data-mw-section-id="66" id="mwMpE" aria-labelledby="Food"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Food">Food</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=2020s&amp;action=edit&amp;section=66" title="Edit section: Food"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwMpI"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Food_delivery" title="Food delivery" id="mwMpM">Food delivery</a> apps such as <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deliveroo" title="Deliveroo" id="mwMpQ">Deliveroo</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/DoorDash" title="DoorDash" id="mwMpU">DoorDash</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Instacart" title="Instacart" id="mwMpY">Instacart</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Menulog" title="Menulog" id="mwMpc">Menulog</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Uber_Eats" title="Uber Eats" id="mwMpg">Uber Eats</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grubhub" title="Grubhub" id="mwMpk">Grubhub</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bolt_Food" title="Bolt Food" id="mwMpo">Bolt Food</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wolt" title="Wolt" id="mwMps">Wolt</a>, and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Just_Eat_Takeaway" title="Just Eat Takeaway" class="mw-redirect" id="mwMpw">Just Eat Takeaway</a> became more popular since to the COVID-19 pandemic.<sup about="#mwt3986" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1083" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1083&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1083" id="mwMp0"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMp4"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMp8">[</span>1083<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMqA">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt3989" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1084" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1084&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1084" id="mwMqE"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMqI"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMqM">[</span>1084<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMqQ">]</span></span></a></sup> Indoor dining was also closed in many countries due to the COVID-19 pandemic, and upon re-opening the usage of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/QR_code" title="QR code" id="mwMqU">QR codes</a> and other technologies in the restaurant industry increased compared to the 2010s in order to comply with pandemic restrictions.<sup about="#mwt3992" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1085" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1085&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1085" id="mwMqY"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMqc"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMqg">[</span>1085<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMqk">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt3995" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1086" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1086&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1086" id="mwMqo"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMqs"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMqw">[</span>1086<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMq0">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwMq4">Due to the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/COVID-19_lockdowns" title="COVID-19 lockdowns" id="mwMq8">COVID-19 restrictions</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Online_grocer" title="Online grocer" id="mwMrA">online grocery shopping</a> has substantially grown and in the first few months of the pandemic, online grocery shopping increased by 300%.<sup about="#mwt3998" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1087" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1087&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1087" id="mwMrE"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMrI"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMrM">[</span>1087<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMrQ">]</span></span></a></sup> Before the pandemic occurred, food shopping activity accounted for 9% of the market, now 63% of consumers worldwide have purchased more groceries online after the outbreak than they did before they were socially isolated.<sup about="#mwt4001" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1088" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1088&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1088" id="mwMrU"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMrY"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMrc">[</span>1088<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMrg">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="67" id="mwMrk" aria-labelledby="Literature"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Literature">Literature</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=2020s&amp;action=edit&amp;section=67" title="Edit section: Literature"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt4002" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwMro" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Expand section&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Expand_section&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;date&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;January 2025&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1364180890" about="#mwt4003" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Message box/ambox.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}"></span><table class="box-Expand_section plainlinks metadata ambox mbox-small-left ambox-content" role="presentation" about="#mwt4002"><tbody><tr><td class="mbox-image"><span typeof="mw:File mw:ExpandedAttrs" about="#mwt4004" data-mw="{&quot;attribs&quot;:[[&quot;alt&quot;,{&quot;html&quot;:&quot;alt=<span typeof=\&quot;mw:Entity\&quot; id=\&quot;mwMrs\&quot;>[</span>icon<span typeof=\&quot;mw:Entity\&quot; id=\&quot;mwMrw\&quot;>]</span>&quot;,&quot;txt&quot;:&quot;[icon]&quot;}]]}"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Wiki_letter_w_cropped.svg" class="mw-file-description"><img alt="[icon]" resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Wiki_letter_w_cropped.svg" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1c/Wiki_letter_w_cropped.svg/20px-Wiki_letter_w_cropped.svg.png" decoding="async" data-file-width="44" data-file-height="31" data-file-type="drawing" height="14" width="20" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1c/Wiki_letter_w_cropped.svg/40px-Wiki_letter_w_cropped.svg.png 2x" class="mw-file-element"></a></span></td><td class="mbox-text"><div class="mbox-text-span">This section <b>needs expansion</b>. You can help by <a rel="mw:ExtLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=2020s&amp;action=edit&amp;section=" class="external text" data-mw-original-href="//en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=2020s&amp;action=edit&amp;section=">adding missing information</a>.  <span class="date-container"><i>(<span class="date">January 2025</span>)</i></span></div></td></tr></tbody></table><span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt4002"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_to_be_expanded_from_January_2025"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:All_articles_to_be_expanded"></span>
<span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt4005" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwMr0" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Main&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Main&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Category:2020s in literature&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1353705441" about="#mwt4006" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Hatnote/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}"></span><div role="note" class="hatnote navigation-not-searchable" about="#mwt4005" id="mwMr4">Main page: <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Category:2020s_in_literature" title="Category:2020s in literature">Category:2020s in literature</a></div>
<p id="mwMr8">Books published throughout the decade include <i id="mwMsA">The Vanishing Half</i>, <i id="mwMsE">Leave the World Behind</i>, <i id="mwMsI">Transcendent Kingdom</i>, <i id="mwMsM">Memorial</i> and <i id="mwMsQ">The City We Became</i>. Recent releases on this decade include <i id="mwMsU"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/How_to_Prevent_the_Next_Pandemic" title="How to Prevent the Next Pandemic" id="mwMsY">How to Prevent the Next Pandemic</a></i> by <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bill_Gates" title="Bill Gates" id="mwMsc">Bill Gates</a>, <i id="mwMsg">Meet Me by the Fountain: An Inside History of the Mall</i> by Alexandra Lange, <i id="mwMsk"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia_@_20" title="Wikipedia @ 20" id="mwMso">Wikipedia @ 20</a></i> by <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Joseph_M._Reagle_Jr." title="Joseph M. Reagle Jr." class="mw-redirect" id="mwMss">Joseph M. Reagle Jr.</a> and Jackie Koerner, and <i id="mwMsw"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Candy_House_(novel)" title="The Candy House (novel)" id="mwMs0">The Candy House</a></i>.<sup about="#mwt4009" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1089" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1089&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1089" id="mwMs4"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMs8"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMtA">[</span>1089<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMtE">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt4012" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1090" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1090&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-1090" id="mwMtI"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMtM"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMtQ">[</span>1090<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMtU">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

</section></section><section data-mw-section-id="68" id="mwMtY" aria-labelledby="See_also"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="See_also">See also</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=2020s&amp;action=edit&amp;section=68" title="Edit section: See also"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
