<li id="mwMtw"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2020s_in_political_history" title="2020s in political history" class="mw-redirect" id="mwMt0">2020s in political history</a></li></ul>

<section data-mw-section-id="69" id="mwMt4" aria-labelledby="Timeline"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Timeline">Timeline</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=2020s&amp;action=edit&amp;section=69" title="Edit section: Timeline"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwMt8">The following articles contain brief timelines which list the most prominent events of the decade:</p>
<span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt4015" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwMuA" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;hlist&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Hlist&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;[[2020]] &quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; [[2021]] &quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; [[2022]] &quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; [[2023]] &quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;[[2024]]&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; [[2025]] &quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; '''[[2026]]''' &quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; [[2027]] &quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; [[2028]] &quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; [[2029]]&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333133064" about="#mwt4016" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Hlist/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}"></span><div class="hlist" about="#mwt4015" id="mwMuE"><ul><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2020" title="2020">2020</a></li><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2021" title="2021">2021</a></li><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022" title="2022">2022</a></li><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2023" title="2023">2023</a></li><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2024" title="2024">2024</a></li><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2025" title="2025">2025</a></li><li><b><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026" title="2026">2026</a></b></li><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2027" title="2027">2027</a></li><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2028" title="2028">2028</a></li><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2029" title="2029">2029</a></li></ul></div>

</section></section><section data-mw-section-id="70" id="mwMuI" aria-labelledby="Notes"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Notes">Notes</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=2020s&amp;action=edit&amp;section=70" title="Edit section: Notes"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
