ty_Press" title="Duke University Press" id="mwPI0">Duke University Press</a>. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwPI4">&nbsp;</span><span class="nowrap" id="mwPI8">xix–</span>xx, 134, <span class="nowrap" id="mwPJA">197–</span>99. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISBN_(identifier)" title="ISBN (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwPJE">ISBN</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwPJI">&nbsp;</span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:BookSources/978-0-8223-6949-3" title="Special:BookSources/978-0-8223-6949-3" id="mwPJM"><bdi id="mwPJQ">978-0-8223-6949-3</bdi></a>.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=Red+Hangover%3A+Legacies+of+Twentieth-Century+Communism&amp;rft.pages=xix-xx%2C+134%2C+197-99&amp;rft.pub=Duke+University+Press&amp;rft.date=2017&amp;rft.isbn=978-0-8223-6949-3&amp;rft.aulast=Ghodsee&amp;rft.aufirst=Kristen&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.dukeupress.edu%2Fred-hangover&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2020s" class="Z3988" about="#mwt829" id="mwPJU"></span></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-235" id="cite_note-235" data-mw-footnote-number="235"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwPJY"><a href="#cite_ref-235" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwPJc"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwPJg">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-235" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt832" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwPJk" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite &quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot; web &quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Cliffe &quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Jeremy &quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=2023-02-15 &quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=The Strange Death of the Centre Right &quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://www.newstatesman.com/international-politics/2023/02/strange-death-centre-right-moderate-conservatism &quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url-status=live &quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230225082048/https://www.newstatesman.com/international-politics/2023/02/strange-death-centre-right-moderate-conservatism &quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;archive-date=2023-02-25 &quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;website=New Statesman&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFCliffe2023" class="citation web cs1" about="#mwt832">Cliffe, Jeremy (15 February 2023). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.newstatesman.com/international-politics/2023/02/strange-death-centre-right-moderate-conservatism" class="external text" id="mwPJo">"The Strange Death of the Centre Right"</a>. <i id="mwPJs">New Statesman</i>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20230225082048/https://www.newstatesman.com/international-politics/2023/02/strange-death-centre-right-moderate-conservatism" class="external text" id="mwPJw">Archived</a> from the original on 25 February 2023.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=New+Statesman&amp;rft.atitle=The+Strange+Death+of+the+Centre+Right&amp;rft.date=2023-02-15&amp;rft.aulast=Cliffe&amp;rft.aufirst=Jeremy&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.newstatesman.com%2Finternational-politics%2F2023%2F02%2Fstrange-death-centre-right-moderate-conservatism&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2020s" class="Z3988" about="#mwt832" id="mwPJ0"></span></span></li>
