 English language networks"</a>. <i id="mwXqE">Fox Sports</i> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwXqI">–</span> via X (Formerly known as Twitter).</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=Fox+Sports&amp;rft.atitle=A+legendary+game+calls+for+a+legendary+viewership+number+as+10%2C784%2C000+viewers+watched+the+World+Baseball+Classic+final+on+FOX+and+FOX+Deportes+-+the+most-watched+WBC+telecast+ever+%3Cbr+%2F%3E+The+2026+WBC+averaged+1%2C294%2C000+viewers+across+FOX%2C+FS1+and+FS2%2C+making+it+the+most-watched+WBC+in+its+20-year+history+across+%28US%29+English+language+networks.&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fx.com%2FFOXSportsPR%2Fstatus%2F2034743694239138052&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2020s" class="Z3988" about="#mwt3954" id="mwXqM"></span></span></li>
